  <para style="toc3">Dit</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ditrọnọmi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ewʌhọ Adikpọñ Họreb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Ami ado mme ikọ ake Moses aketañña anọ afịd Isrel ke anaan ke usakkautịn Yọdan, a-adooho ke Araba, nsakiso Sọf, a-adaaha ke ufọọd Paran ye Tofel, Laban, Haserọd ye Disahab. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />(Usen duob mme keed ke edat esaña tọọñọ ke Họreb ekewuọ Kades Banie ke eboiyoke ke usʌñ Abod Sei.)<verse eid="DEU 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Ke ayọhọ isua aba, ke akpa usen ke ayọhọ afiọñ duob mme keed, Moses amaadọkkọ mbon Isrel afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akewuuk anye abaña nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Anye akenam ami ke ini anye amaakekan Sihọn, adidem mbon Amọọ, a-akekarake ke Hesbọn, ye ke Edrei, anyʌñ akan Ọk, adidem mbon Basan a-akekarake ke Astarọd.<verse eid="DEU 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Ke usakkautịn Yọdan ke efaak mbon Mọb, Moses amaatọọñọ adiyaara mbed ami, ate:<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn akebo ñnyịn ke Họreb, “Ndufo emeba ekpeene ebọhọ ke abod ami. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Isuan itieidʌñ ndufo ndin idʌk ikaa ke abod mbon Amọọ; ikaiya ke afịd mbọhọidʌñ mbon Araba, ke mme ñkpoon abod, ke usuuk abod ke usobutịn, ke Nekef ye mben inyañ, tutu akewuọ isọñ mbon Kenan, tutu Lebanọn, tutu akewuọ ekamba akpa, e-ediọọñọke nte Yufretis. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Se se, ami mminọ ndufo isọñ ami. Ikaa ikidat isọñ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke abo ke iyainọ mme ete ndufo, inọ Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb, tutu awuọ mme nditọ ammọ ye ubon se ikeene ammọ ke edem.”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adimek mme Adaukara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Idaha ntoro ami mmaibo ndufo, “Ndufo emekpon ekan se ami ñkan mbiom ikpọọñ. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo a-anam ibad ndufo atọt, anam mfịn ndufo emetara, ewak nte ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, anam ndufo etọt utịm tọsịn anyʌñ idiọñ ndufo kpa naña anye akenwọñọ! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Ado ndiikan die ñyọ mfịna ye ukuud ndufo ye utọk ndufo ke idem mmi ikpọọñ? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Mek mbon aniọñ, mbon ifiọk, mbon ukpono ke esiin ndufo keedekeed, ndin ñyaanam ammọ ikara ndufo.”<verse eid="DEU 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Ndufo emaembọọrọ miin ete, “Se afo ayem adinam a-afọn.”<verse eid="DEU 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Ndin mmaakoono mme awuọiso awo, mbon aniọñ ye mbon ukpono ke mme esiin keedekeed, ñnyʌñ nnam ammọ ikara ndufo, nte adaiso e-ekaarake mme tọsịn, mme ikie, mme aba mme duob ye mme duob ye nte mme adaaha e-ekarake efaak. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Ndin ami mmaanọ mme abiideikpe ndufo uyio ke ini ado nte, “Ikop utọk mbon ndufo inyʌñ ibiere nnen-nnen, me ado ke atu mbon Isrel iba me ado ke atu awo Isrel ye asenawo a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Ikiiteeñe awo anyen ke ubiideikpe; ikop ito etək ye ekamba ukem-ukem. Ikiibaak awo ndomokeed anyen, sia ubiideikpe anie Abasi. Iben ikpe se isọñ ikan ndufo insọk miin, ndin ami ñyaakop.” <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Ndin ke ini ado ami mmaidọkkọ ndufo afịd se akenaa nte enam.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edọñ Mbon Uyeb Utom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />Ndin, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn akiinọọ ñnyịn ewʌhọ, ñnyịn imaito ke Họreb isaña ika abod idịd mbon Amọọ iboiyo aniendịk anaan a-ndufo ekịtte, ndin imaikisịm Kades Banie. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Ndin ami mmaibo ndufo, “Emewuọ abod mbon Amọọ, <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn inọọhọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Se, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọ isọñ ami. Ikaa ikiben idat kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme ete ndufo akibo ndufo. Ikiifeghe ndịk; ikinie iduọesịd.”<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Ndin afịd ndufo emaedi embịne miin enyʌñ ebo, “Yak ñnyịn idọñ mbon awo nọ ekeyep isọñ ado inọ ñnyịn ndin edat etob etịmme isọk ñnyịn ebaña usʌñ naña ñnyịn idiisaña ye mme abio se idiidʌk.”<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Akikere ado akemba miin nte a-afọn; ke ntoro ami mmaasio awo duob mme iba ke atu ndufo, awo keed ke esiin keed. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Ammọ emaedaaña edọọk ke abod idịd ado, ediwuọ Itịkke Eskol enyʌñ ekeduuñọ anye. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Ammọ emaedat mme mfịd ke idịd ado eben edi enyʌñ inọ ñnyịn ndin ebo, “Ado eti isọñ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn inọọ ñnyịn.”<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsọñiwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Ado ndufo ikinyịmmeke edidọọk ñkaa; emaesọñ iwuod, isañake ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Ndufo emaedukuunọ ke mme atayad ndufo enyʌñ ebo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> isuasua ñnyịn; ntak ado anam anye isio ñnyịn ke isọñ Iyib iben ñnyịn adisịn ke ubọk mbon Amọọ nọ isobo ñnyịn. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Uke ke ñnyịn ikpikaa? Nditọete ñnyịn enam nsia ikịppe ñnyịn ye ndịk. Ammọ ebo, ‘Ibon ado ekop adudu enyʌñ edunyọñ ikan ñnyịn; mme abio ammọ ekpoon, ndibene akewuọ ikpaanyọñ. Ke akpanikọ, ñnyịn imaikịt mbon Anak do.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Ndin ami mmaibo ndufo, “Ikiikop ndịk; ikiifeghe ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-asañake ke iso ndufo, ayaanwana ekọñ inọ ndufo, kpa naña anye akenam ke Iyib, ndin ndufo emaekịt ke anyen ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />ke anaan. Ke ndo ndufo emaekịt naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akikama ndufo, nte ete akama ayịn amọ, ke afịd itie nte ekesaña tutu ediwuọ itie ami.”<verse eid="DEU 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Kpayeado, ndufo isʌkkọ inie mbuọdidem ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />a-akidatta ndufo usʌñ ke isañ ndufo, ke ikañ ke akonayio ye ke ntọñanyọñ ke uweemeayio, adikiyem itie inọ ndufo nte ediibono anyʌñ iwọt ndufo usʌñ se ediisaña.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />Ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakekop se ndufo eketañ, anye amaayat esịd anyʌñ anwọñọ: <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />“Awo ndomokeed ke ubon idiọọk emana ami idiikịtte eti isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke nnọ mme eteete ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />ke imiibọhọke Kaleb ayịn Yefune. Anye ayaakịt, ndin ñyaanọ anye ye ubon amọ isọñ a-anye adotto ukod, sia anye amaakeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd esịd.”<verse eid="DEU 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Ato ke ntak ndufo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd ye ami ñko anyʌñ abo, “Afo ñko uduudʌkkọ ke esịd. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Ado udiana mfo, Yọsua, ayịn Nọn, ayaadʌk ke esịd. Sọọñọ anye isịn sia anye adiidat nditọ Isrel yak ekedat isọñ ado enie. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Ndin ntəkayịn a-ndufo ekebooho ke eyaekoono ammọ nte ifʌn, nditọ i-imiidiọọñọke se ido eti ye se ido idiọọk, mbon ado eyaedʌk isọñ ado edat enie. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Amaado ndufo, ikanna iso inyʌñ isaña ikaa ukañ akpautatan ke usʌñ a-akaaha Ndad-Ndad Akpainyañ.”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />Ndin ndufo emaebọọrọ, “Ñnyịn imidue <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ñnyịn iyaikaa ikinwana, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn akinọọ ñnyịn uyio.” Ke ntoro afịd ndufo emaebọbọ mme mbọbọekọñ, e-ekere ke ado mmem-mmem ñkpọ adidọọk ñkaa abod-abod abio ado.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Dọkkọ ammọ, ‘Ikiikaa ikinwana sia ami ndiisañake ye ndufo. Mme asua ndufo eyaikan ndufo.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Ami mmaidọkkọ ndufo, ado ndufo ikikoppo. Ndufo emaesọñ iwuod ye ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin ke ñkokkoidem ndufo emaenam isañ edọọk ekaa idịd abod ado. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Mbon Amọọ e-ekedʌññọ ke mme abod ado emaewuọ edi ekọñ ye ndufo; ammọ emaibịne ndufo nte ayọ akwọọk enyʌñ ikan ndufo atọọñọke ke Sei tutu akewuọ Họma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ndufo emaetịmme edi editua ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado anye ikibọọrọke ndufo anyʌñ amia utọñ asio akpọñ ayịd ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Ndin ndufo emaetie ke Kades ke uwak usen ke afịd ini se ndufo ekeba do.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s1">Uyooñ ke Anaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Ndin ñnyịn imaiwọññọ isak iso ise anaan ke usʌñ Ndad-Ndad Akpainyañ, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akentemme miin. Ke anyan ini ñnyịn imaiyem usʌñ ñnyịn ikanna abod idịd Sei.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />“Ndufo emekanna ke abod idịd ami ekpeene; idahami, ikanna idọọk adoro. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Nọ mbon awo mme ewʌhọ ami: ‘Ndufo eyaesọp ediboiyo ke efaak mme ayakka ndufo, mbon ubon Isọ, e-edʌññọ ke Sei. Ammọ eyaebaak ndufo, ado inekke ikpeme idem. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Ikiitọọñọ ekọñ ye ammọ, sia ami ndiinọọhọ ndufo isọñ ammọ ndomokeed, ukpọk se ekap edodot ukod. Ami mmenọ Isọ abod idịd Sei nte udeeme amọ. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Ana ndufo ekpe ammọ ke silfa ke ndidia se edia ye ke mmọọñ se enwọñ.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo i-idiọñ ndufo ke afịd se ubọk ndufo atuuk anam. Anye i-ikpeme ndufo ke usʌñisañ ndufo ke afịd anaan ami. Ke isua aba ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo abere ye ndufo, ndufo inanake ñkpọ ndomokeed.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Ndin ñnyịn imaisaña iboiyo ubon Isọ mme imaan ñnyịn, e-edʌññọ ke Sei. Ñnyịn imaiwọññọ ke usʌñ Araba, a-atooho Elad ye Esiọn Keba, i-inyʌñ isaña ke usʌñ akpautatan Mọb.<verse eid="DEU 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Kuufịna mbon Mọb, kuunyʌñ unək ammọ usịn ke ekọñ, sia Ami nduunọọhọ mbeñe isọñ ammọ ndomokeed. Ami mmeben Ar nnọ ubon Lọọd nte udeeme inie ammọ.”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />Mbon Emịm ekesidʌññọ do, mbon uko enyʌñ ewak, edunyọñ nte mbon Anak. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Nte mbon Anak, ekenyʌñ edat ammọ nte mbon Refaim, ado mbon Mọb ekekoot ammọ mbon Emịm. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Mbon Hori ekesidʌñ ke Sei, ado ubon Isọ emaebịne ammọ esịññe. Ammọ emaesobo mbon Hori edat isọñ ammọ edʌñọ, kpa naña Isrel akenam ke isọñ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ammọ nte udeeme inie ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Idahami dakka da boiyo Abedeñ Sered.” Ndin ñnyịn imaiboiyo abedeñ ado.<verse eid="DEU 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Isua edịb mme duob mme itiaita amaaboiyo tọọñọ ñnyịn ikikpọñ Kades Banie tutu ñnyịn iboiyo Abedeñ Sered. Ke idaha ado, afịd udịm emana ideen mme anwana ekọñ emaekpañña ke esob ado, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọ anọ ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadoro ammọ tutu anye asobo ammọ afịd-afịd ke esob.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Ndin ke ini akpatre mme anwanaekọñ ami emaekekpañña, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />“Mfịn ami ana afo asaña aboiyo ke efaak mbon Mọb ke Ar. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Emaediwuọ mbon Amọn, ikiifịna ammọ, ikiinyʌñ idat ammọ isịn ke ekọñ, sia ami ndiinọọhọ ndufo udeeme isọñ ndomokeed a-anieghe mbon Amọn. Ami mmeyaak nnọ ubon Lọọd nte udeeme.”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />(Itie ado ñko ekedat nte isọñ mbon Refaim, ekesidʌññọ do; ado mbon Amọn ekekoot ammọ mbon Samsum. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Ammọ emaekop uko enyʌñ ewak, edunyọñ ñko nte mbon Anak. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasobo ammọ ke iso mbon Amọn, e-ekebịnne ammọ esio enyʌñ eben isọñ ammọ edʌñọ, <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam ukem ado anọ ubon Isọ, e-ekedʌññọ ke Sei, ke ini Anye akesoboke mbon Hori asio anọ ammọ. Ammọ emaebịne ammọ esio enyʌñ edʌñọ do tutu usen mfịn. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Amaado mbon Afịm ekedʌññọ ke mme esịd idʌñ tutu akewuọ Kasa, mbon Kaftọ e-etooho Kaftọ emaesobo ammọ enyʌñ edʌñ ke isọñ ammọ.)<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukan Sihọn Adidem Hesbọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Dakka idahami kaaña Abedeñ Anọn. Se, Ami mmeyaak Sihọn awo Amọọ, adidem Hesbọn ye idịd amọ nsịn ke ubọk mfo. Tọọñọ adidat udeeme ado nnie nyʌñ tọọñọ ekọñ ye anye. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Kpa ke usen ami, ñyaatọọñọ adisịn ndịk ye mbaak ndufo ke esịd afịd mme idịd ke idak anyọñ. Ammọ eyaekop etob ndufo eyaenyʌñ enyeñ idem enyʌñ eba ke ayeemensia ke ntak ndufo.”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />Tọọñọ ke Akpautatan Kedemọd ami mmaadọñ mme isʌñutom nnọ Sihọn adidem Hesbọn mbeeñe emem ñnyʌñ mbo, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />“Yak ñnyịn isaña iboiyo ke idịd ndufo. Ñnyịn idiisaña ke akpọusʌñ; ñnyịn idiiwakkake idʌk nnasia me ufiin. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Nyam ndidia inọ ñnyịn idia ye mmọọñ se inwọñ ke udua ke silfa. Ado mbọk yak isaña ke ukod iboiyo, <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />kpa naña ubon Isọ, e-edʌññọ ke Sei, ye mbon Mọb, e-edʌññọ ke Ar, ekenam inọọ ñnyịn tutu ñnyịn ikaaña Yọdan idʌk isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn inọọhọ ñnyịn.” <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Ado Sihọn adidem Hesbọn amaasịn adiyaak nọ ñnyịn isaña iboiyo. Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaanam sịbidịd amọ asọñ anyʌñ asọñ anye esịd nọ anye ayaak anye isịn ndufo ke ubọk, kpa naña anye anam idahami.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Se, Ami mmetọọñọ adiyaak Sihọn ye idịd amọ isịn ndufo ke ubọk. Tọọñọ ndin adikan ñnyʌñ ndat isọñ amọ nnie.”<verse eid="DEU 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Ke ini Sihọn ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ ekewuọhọ edi edisoobo ñnyịn ke ekọñ ke Yahas, <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn amaayaak anye isịn ñnyịn ke ubọk ndin ñnyịn imaisobo anye, ye nditọ ideen amọ ye afịd ekpək amọ. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Ke ini ado ñnyịn imaidat afịd abio amọ inyʌñ isobo ataa afịd-afịd ammọ, ideen, ibaan ye ntəkayịn. Ñnyịn ikisʌhọke awo ndomokeed. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Ado mme ufene ye mbịme ekọñ e-eketooho mme abio a-ñnyịn ikisoboke, ñnyịn imaikoono inọ idem ñnyịn. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Tọọñọ ke Arowa ke mben Abedeñ Anọn, ndin tọọñọ ke abio a-akebaaha ke abedeñ ado, tutu akewuọ Kilied, ibaaha abio ndomokeed se akekoppo uko ikan ñnyịn. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn amaayaak afịd ado inọ ñnyịn. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Ado ke asañake akekem ke ewʌhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, ndufo ikinyaañake adaña ke isọñ mbon Amọn, me ke isọñ ke mben Yabọk me anye a-akannake mme abio ke mme abod.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ekan Ọk Adidem Basan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />Akema ñnyịn imaiwọññọ idọọk usʌñ a-akaaha Basan, ndin Ọk adidem Basan ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ emaewuọ edi edisoobo ye ñnyịn ke ekọñ ke Edrei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Kuuyak ndịk amọ unam fiin, sia ami mmeyaak anye usịn fiin ke ubọk, ye afịd mbon ekọñ amọ ye isọñ amọ. Nam ye anye ukem se afo akenam ye Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ, a-akekarake ke Hesbọn.”<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn amaayaak Ọk adidem Basan ye afịd udịmekọñ amọ asịn ke ubọk ñnyịn. Ñnyịn imaisobo ammọ, isʌhọke awo ndomokeed. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Ke ini ado ñnyịn imaikoono afịd mme abio amọ. Ikibaaha keed ke atu mme abio ata ado a-ñnyịn imiikibọiyọ ammọ, afịd efaak Arkob, ke idak ukara Ọk ke Basan. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Afịd mme abio ami emaenieñe mme ñnyan ndibene ye mme atob e-ekpahakekpaha, emaenyʌñ enie mme esịdidʌñ a-awo imiikibọppọ ndibene ikanna. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Ñnyịn imaisobo ammọ ataa afịd-afịd, kpa naña ikinam ye Sihọn adidem Hesbọn, imaisobo afịd abio, ideen, ibaan ye ntəkayịn. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Ado afịd mme ufene ye mbịme ke mme abio ammọ ñnyịn imaibiom inyọñọ inọ idem ñnyịn.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Ndin ke ini ado ñnyịn imaibọ mme ndidem mbon Amọọ iba ami isọñ ke usakkautịn Yọdan, tọọñọ ke abedeñ Anọn tutu akewuọ Abod Hemọn. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />(Hemọn ke mbon Sidọn ekoot Siriọn; mbon Amọọ ekoot Seni.) <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Ñnyịn imaikoono afịd mme abio ke unaisọñ, ye ke Kilied, ye afịd Basan tutu aben akewuọ Saleka ye Edrei, mme abio idak ukara Ọk ke Basan. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />(Ọk adidem Basan akedo akpatre ke atu mbon Refaim. Ekekama ukwak ebana ikʌk amọ a-akenyọọñọ akan kubid usʌkkeed ndin ukpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte ikpad 14 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 6 ke ukpa me mita 4 ke unyọọñ ye mita 1.8 ke ukpa</char></note> amọ akenwaña ke kubid inaañ. Ikʌk ado asʌk ababa ke Raba ake mbon Amọn.)<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Udeeme Isọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />Ke atu isọñ se ñnyịn ikikoono ke ini ado, ami mmaanọ ubon Rubịn ye ubon Kad efaak a-abaaha ke adoro Arowa ke mben Abedeñ Anọn, dian ye ubaak abod idịd Kilied, ye mme abio amọ. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Ñyọhọ nsʌhọ afịd mbon Kilied ye afịd Basan, abio Ọk, ami ñkenọ ubaak esiin Manase. (Ekesidiọọñọ afịd efaak Arkob ke Basan nte isọñ mbon Refaim. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yai, a-atooho ubon Manase, amaadat afịd efaak Arkob tutu akediañña adaña ye mbon Kesọọ ye awo Maakad; ekekoot edian anye, ke ntak ado tutu awuọ usen nte mfịn ami ekoot Basan Hafọd Yai.) <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Ndin ami mmaaben Kilied nnọ Makia. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Ado ubon Rubịn ye ubon Kad ami ñkenọ efaak a-atọọñọke ke Kilied tutu akediañña ke Abedeñ Anọn (ufọọd abedeñ ado adaña), awuọ Inyañ Yabọk, a-adooho adaña ye mbon Amọn. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Adaña amọ ke usobutịn akedo Yọdan ke Araba, tọọñọ ke Kinered tutu ke Akpainyañ Araba (a-adooho, Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ), ke usuuk Piska.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />Ami mmainọ ndufo ewʌhọ idaha ado: “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọ ndufo isọñ edat enie. Ado afịd mme akop idem ideen ndufo, e-ebeeñeke idem uka ekọñ, ana ebọhọ mbon Isrel mfen eka iso. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Ado ibaan ndufo, nditọ ndufo ye ufene ndufo (ami mmediọọñọ ke emenie uwak ufene) ekeme ediba ke mme abio a-ami inọọhọ ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />tutu <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ emọ-emọ nditọ Isrel nduọkadudu naña anye inọọ ndufo, tutu ammọ ñko enyʌñ edat udeeme isọñ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anọọhọ ammọ ke edem Yọdan enie. Ke emaema ado, ndufo keedekeed emekeme editịmme ñkaa ñkedat udeeme a-ami inọọhọ ndufo.”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiọọñọ Moses Adikaaña Yọdan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Ke ini ado ami mmaawuuk Yọsua mbo: “Afo amekịt ke anyen mfo afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anam ye mme ndidem iba ami. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ukem ado ye afịd mme ebekpo ukara ke itie a-ndufo ekaiyake do. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Kuubaak ammọ; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke idem amọ adiinwana inọ ndufo.”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />Ke ini ado ami mmaakpeiye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, Afo ametọọñọ adiwọt ayịnufọk mfo ubom ye akpọsọñ ubọk mfo. Sia akee abasi aba ke hefịn me ke isọñ a-akemeke adinam mme edinam ye mme ñkpoon utom se afo anam? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Yak ami mboiyo ñka ñkese eti isọñ ado ke edem Yọdan, uyaiya abod idịd ado ye Lebanọn.”<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Ado ke ntak ndufo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd ye ami, ndin ke ntak ado anye ikibeeñeke idem adikpañ utọñ innọ miin. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo ate “Akem, kuuneme nneme ado aba ye ami. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Dọọk kaa anyọñ Piska nyʌñ da se usobutịn ye adoro ye usuuk ye usakkautịn. Se isọñ ado ke anyen mfo, sia afo umuuduukaañake Yọdan ami. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Ado dọñ Yọsua, nyʌñ sọọñọ anye idem, sia anye adiidat mbon ami ikaaña, adiinyʌñ inam ammọ edat isọñ se afo uduukịt inie.” <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Ndin ñnyịn imaiba ke abedeñ a-akpereke Bed Pio.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ana Nsuukiwuod Aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Ndin, Isrel, kop mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed a-ami ñyemme adikpeep ndufo. Nịm mme mbed ami nọ ndufo edu uwem enyʌñ ekaa ekedat udeeme isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Kuudian, kuunyʌñ usosio ke ewʌhọ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo, ado nịm mme mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo a-ami inọọhọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Ndufo emaekịt ke anyen ndufo se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam ke Baal Pọọ. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaasobo afịd awo e-ekekeeneke Baal ake Pọọ ke atu ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />ado afịd ndufo se ikimʌm <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ikama mmọdo ke uwem eba tutu mfịn ami.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Se, ami mmiikpeep ndufo mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi akennọọ ewʌhọ, nọ ndufo enịm mme ewʌhọ ado ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaaha edidat nte udeeme ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Inekke ikpeme mme ewʌhọ ami sia ado ayaaben aniọñ ye ikike a-ndufo enieghe awọt mme idịd, e-ediikop ibaña afịd mme ewʌhọ ami, ndin enyʌñ ebo, “Ke akpanikọ ekamba idịd ami a-anie eti iwuod ye ifiọk.” <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Akee idịd mfen inekke ikpon ndin mme abasi ammọ eba ekpere ammọ ke ukem usʌñ naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ikpere ñnyịn idaha a-ñnyịn ibọññọ akam inọọ anye? <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Akee idịd mfen ikpon tutu anie mme nti ewʌhọ ye mbed nte ñwed mbed a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami?<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Ado ikap ikpeme, inyʌñ inekke ikpeme idem ndufo eti-eti mbaak ndufo edifre se anyen ndufo ekịt me ediwuọ ñkpọñ esịd ndufo adaña nte ndufo eduuho uwem. Ikpeep nditọ ndufo ye nditọ nditọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Itoiyo usen a-ndufo ekedaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke Họreb, ke ini anye akembooho miin, “Koot afịd awo bok nọ edikop mme ikọ mmi nọ ammọ ekpeep edinteeñe miin adaña nte ammọ eduuho uwem ke isọñ ado ediinyʌñ ikpeep nditọ ammọ.” <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Ndufo emaesịkke ekpere edida ke idak ekamba abod naña akesʌkkọ asak ye ikañ tutu ko ke mme hefịn, ye abubịd ntọñanyọñ ye akpọsọñ ekịm. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ inọ ndufo ke ikañ. Ndufo emaekop uyio ado ikikịtte idem; uyio kpọd akeba. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Anye amaayaara edioomo amọ inọ ndufo, mme Mbed Duob, akinọọhọ ndufo ewʌhọ abo yak enam ndin anyʌñ awet ammọ ke itiadñwed iba. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amantemme miin ke ini ado adikpeep ndufo mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed a-anaaha ndufo enịm ke isọñ a-ndufo ediikaaña Yọdan ikinie.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekpan Adikpono Usọsọi Ñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Ndufo ikikịtte ndukpọñ awo ndomokeed ke usen <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> aketañña ikọ ye ndufo ke Họreb ke ikañ. Ke ntoro inekke ikpeme idem ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />mbaak ndufo idinam ndiọi ñkpọ inyʌñ inam usọsọi ñkpọ inọọ idem ndufo, se utọ ñkpọ akpedodo, me ekpebot nte awodeen me awonwaan, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />me nte unam ndomokeed ke isọñ me nte inuen ndomokeed a-afuurọke ke anyọñ, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />me nte ñkpọ a-anyọọnọ ke isọñ me nte iyak ke mmọọñ. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Ndin emaebenne anyen ese ikpaanyọñ enyʌñ ekịt utịn, afiọñ ye ntantaafiọñ, afịd udịm anyọñ, ikiiyak nọ itap ndufo nọ eketuak iwuod enọ ammọ me edinyʌñ ñkpono mme ñkpọ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaakebono ke ikpeghe ke ikpeghe anọ mme idịd ke idak isọñ. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Ado amaado ndufo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaiben ndufo asio ke ikañ utadukwak, asio ke Iyib, nọ ndufo edo udeeme amọ, kpa naña ndufo edo idahami.<verse eid="DEU 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd ye ami ke ntak ndufo, ndin anye amaanwọñọ ke ami ndiikaañake Yọdan ndʌk eti isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo nte udeemeñkpọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Ami ñyaakpa ke isọñ edem umi; ndiikaañake Yọdan; ado ndufo eyaekaaña ekedat eti isọñ ado enie. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Inekke ikpeme mbaak ndufo idifre edioomo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akenamma ye ndufo; ikiinam usọsọi ñkpọ inọọ idem ndufo ke mbid ñkpọ ndomokeed se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaakekpan. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ado ikañ a-ataaha asobo, afịbe ufịb Abasi.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Ndufo imainie nditọ ye nditọnditọ inyʌñ idʌñ ke isọñ ado ke anyan ini, adieke ndufo ebiañake enyʌñ enam usọsọi ñkpọ, enam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ndin enam anye akop iyadesịd, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />ami mmekoot anyọñ ye isọñ nte mme ntiense ibaña ndufo ke usen mfịn ami ke ndufo eyaesọsọp e-esobo ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaañake Yọdan adikidat nnie. Ndufo idiidʌññọ do ikpeene ado eyaisobo ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaisuan ndufo adọñ ke atu mme idịd, ibad-ibad awo ifañ ediisʌhọ ke atu mme idịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiisuan ndufo idọñ. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Ke udo ndufo eyaekpono mme abasi ubọk awo enamma ke eto ye itiad, i-imiikanna ikịt usʌñ me ikop ñkpọ me idia ñkpọ me inuuno ñkpọ. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Ado adieke ke idaha a-ndufo ebaaha do ndufo eyem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi, ndufo eyaekịt anye adieke ndufo eyemme anye ke afịd esịd ndufo ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Ndufo emaeba ke mfịna ndin afịd ñkpọ ami atịppe inọ ndufo, ndin ke akpatre ndufo eyaetịmme ebịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ ekop item amọ. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ado Abasi mbọm; Anye idiikpọññọ ndufo, idiinyʌññọ isobo ndufo, inyʌññọ ifre edioomo a-anye akenamma ye mme eteete ndufo, a-anye akesọọñọke ke enwọñọ.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Ado Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />Ibịp ibaña ini esed, mbemiso ayio ndufo, tọọñọ ke usen A-Abasi akebotto awo ke ederimbod; ibịp tọọñọ ke utịd anyọñ keed tutu akesịm utịd uko. Kpaanam utọ ekamba ñkpọ ntom atịppe, me kpaanam ekop utọ ñkpọ ntom? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Me aba atu mbon e-ekoppo uyio Abasi ato ke ikañ, naña ndufo ekop, ndin esʌk edu uwem? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Kpaanam aba abasi ndomokeed a-adomoke adisio idịd keed ke atu idịd mfen ndat nnọọ idem amọ, ato ke mme idomo, ke mme idiọọñọ ye mme utịppeñkpọ, ke ekọñ, ke akpọsọñ ubọk ye ke adidịppe ubọk, me ke ikpọ ye aniendịk ñkpọ, nte afịd ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akenam ke Iyib ke iso ndufo?<verse eid="DEU 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Ekiwọt ndufo mme ñkpọ ami nọ ndufo ediọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi; ke aboiyoke anye mfen ibaaha. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Tọọñọ ke anyọñ anye amaanam ndufo ekop uyio amọ aditʌnọ ndufo. Ke isọñ anye amaiwọt ndufo ekamba ikañ amọ, enyʌñ ekop ikọ amọ ke ikañ. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Sia anye amaama mme eteete ndufo anyʌñ amek mme ubon ato ammọ, anye isio ndufo ke Iyib ato ke Iso Amọ ye akpọsọñ adudu amọ, <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />abịn mme idịd e-ekpoono enyʌñ ekop uko ikan ndufo anyʌñ idat ndufo adisịn ke isọñ ammọ adiyaak inọ ndufo nte udeemeñkpọ ndufo, kpa naña ado mfịn.<verse eid="DEU 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Idiọọñọ inyʌñ isịn ke esịd ndufo ke usen mfịn ami ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi ke anyọñ ye ke idak isọñ. Mfen ibaaha. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Inịm mme ewʌhọ ye mbed amọ, a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami, nọ afọn ye ndufo ye nditọ ndufo nọ ndufo enyʌñ edu anyan uwem ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo ke afịd ini.<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Abio Ubọkkọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Ndin Moses amaasio abio ita ke usakkautịn Yọdan, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />anịm anọ awo akeedodo i-imiifiọkọfiọk iwot awo ke idiọọkesịd adifeghe ñkaa. Ammọ ekeme edifeghe ñkaa keed ke atu mme abio ado nọ edu uwem. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Mme abio ado edo: Besa ke unaisọñ anaan, enọ ubon Rubịn; Ramọd ke Kilied enọ ubon Kad; ye Kolan ke Basan, enọ ubon Manase.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utọọñọ Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Ami ado mbed ake Moses akenịmme ke iso nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Mme asaña-asaña ewʌhọ ye mme mbed se Moses akenọọ nditọ Isrel idaha ammọ ekewuọhọ ke isọñ Iyib edo ami, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />enyʌñ ekeba ke abedeñ a-akpereke Bed Pio ke usakkautịn Yọdan, ke isọñ Sihọn, adidem mbon Amọọ, a-akekarake ke Hesbọn; ndin Moses ye mbon Isrel emaekan ammọ idaha ekewuọhọ eto Iyib. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Ammọ emaedat isọñ amọ ye isọñ Ọk enie, adidem Basan, ye ndidem mbon Amọọ iba ke usakkautịn Yọdan. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Isọñ ami amaatọọñọ ke Arowa ke mben Abedeñ Anọn tutu ke Abod Siriọn (a-adooho Hemọn), <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />anyʌñ asịne afịd Araba ke usakkautịn Yọdan, tutu akewuọ Ñkpaikpa Akpainyañ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ado Akpainyañ Araba</char></note> ke idak itịkke Piska.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Mbed Duob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Moses amaakoot afịd Isrel ndin abo: Isrel, ikop mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed a-ami ntañña isịn ndufo ke utọñ mfịn ami. Ikpeep ammọ inyʌñ ikịt ibo ke emenam ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn amaanam edioomo ye ñnyịn ke Họreb. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Ikidooho ye mme eteete ñnyịn ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam edioomo ami, ado akedo ye afịd ñnyịn i-iduuho uwem mfịn ami. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ ye ndufo iso ye iso ato ke ikañ ke anyọñ abod. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />(Ke ini ado ami ñkesịne ke ufọọd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ndufo adisiak ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inọọ ndufo, sia ndufo ekekoppo ndịk ikañ ikinyʌññọ idọọk ikaa abod ado.) Ndin anye amaabo:<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />“Ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ami ñkisio ndufo ke Iyib, ke isọñ ufʌn.”<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“Ndufo inaaha enie mme abasi mfen ke amaaboiyo ami.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />Ndufo inaaha enam usọsọi ñkpọ enọ idem ndufo ke mbid ñkpọ ndomokeed ke anyọñ me ke idak isọñ me ke esịd mmọọñ. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Ndufo inaaha etuak iwuod enọ ammọ me enyʌñ ekpono ammọ; sia ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ndo Abasi ufịb, mmia nditọ ufen idiọọkñkpọ mme ete ammọ tutu awuọ emana ita ye inaañ mbon e-ensuaha miin, <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />ado ñwọt ima nnọ mme emana tọsịn mbon e-emmaaha miin enyʌñ enịm mme mbed mmi.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />Ndufo idiidatta anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo isịn ke ndek, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiifeene inọ awo a-asịnne anyịñ amọ ke ndek.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />Ikpeme usen Sabad ke edinịm anye asana, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo itemme ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Ke usen itiokeed ke ndufo enie edinam afịd utom se enie edinam, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />ado ayọhọ usen itiaba ado sabad anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ke usen ado ndufo idiinamma utom ndomokeed, me ndufo, me nditọ ideen, me nditọ ibaan, me ayịnufọk ndufo awonwaan, me ayịnufọk ndufo awodeen, me ayaara enañ ndufo, me dọñki ndufo, me unam ndufo ndomokeed, me adidʌñ e-edʌññọ ke mme abio ndufo; ke ntoro mme nditọufọk ndufo ideen mme ibaan eyaeduọk adudu, kpa naña ndufo eduọk. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Itoiyo ke ndufo ekedo ifʌn ke Iyib ndin ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akenyan akwa ubọk amọ ifak ndufo asio. Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anịm mbed ate ekpeme usen Sabad.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />Kpono ete ye eka, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anọ mbed, nọ ndufo edu uwem ekpeene ñko nọ ñkpọ anyʌñ ifọn ndufo ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />Ikiiwot awo.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />Ikiisịn efịbe.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />Kuuyịp inọ.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />Ikiitie ntiense nsu idian mbọhọidʌñ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />Ikiisịn anyen ke anwaan mbọhọidʌñ ndufo. Ikiisịn anyen ke ufọk mbọhọidʌñ ndufo me ke isọñ, me ke ayịnufọk awodeen me ayịnufọk awonwaan amọ, me ayaara enañ me dọñki, me ñkpọ ndomokeed a-anieghe mbọhọidʌñ ndufo.”<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />Ami edo mme mbed <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> atañña ke akpọsọñ uyio anọ afịd atu awo ke abod, a-atooho ke ikañ, ke ntọñanyọñ ye ke akpọsọñ ekịm; anye ikinyʌññọ idian ñkpọ mfen aba. Ndin anye amaawet ke anyọñ itiadñwed iba ayaak annọ miin.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />Ini a-ndufo ekekoppo uyio a-atooho ke ekịm, ke ini ikañ akesakka ke ekamba abod, afịd mme adadusʌñ ye mme ñkpisọñ esiin ndufo emaedi embịne miin. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Ndin ndufo emaebo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn iwọt ñnyịn ubọọñ amọ ye uku amọ, ndin ñnyịn imikop uyio amọ ke ikañ. Mfịn ami ñnyịn imikịt ke awo akeme adidu uwem adieke Abasi atañña ikọ ye anye. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Ndin idahami, ntak a-ñnyịn ikpikpaññakee? Ekamba ikañ ami ayaisobo ñnyịn, ndin ñnyịn iyaikpa adieke ñnyịn isʌkkọ ikaa iso ikop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Sia kpaanam, anie awo akop uyio aduuwem Abasi a-awuọhọ ke ikañ, naña ñnyịn ikop, ndin adu uwem? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Saña kpere nyʌñ kpañ utọñ nọ afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn abo. Ndin idọkkọ ñnyịn se anye akpetatañ unọọ fiin. Ñnyịn iyaikpañ utọñ inyʌñ inam.”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop idaha a-ndufo eketañña ikọ ye ami, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Ami mmekop se mbon ami udọkkọ fiin. Afịd se ammọ etañ a-afọn. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Akpekapado esịd ammọ e-ewọññọ eñkeene miin ye uteeñe enyʌñ enịm mme mbed mmi afịd ini, nọ ato do afọn ye ammọ ye nditọ ammọ ke nsi-nsi!<verse eid="DEU 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />“Kaa, bo ammọ enyọñ edi atayad ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Ado afo tie mi ye ami nọ ami unọ afịd item, ewʌhọ ye mbed a-afo anaaha akpeep ammọ nọ enam ke isọñ a-ami nnọọhọ ammọ mbo edat enie.”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Ndin inekke ikpeme inyʌñ inam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo abo ndufo enam; ikiiwọññọ idʌk nnasia me ufiin. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Isaña ke ñkobitem ke afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo iwuuk ndufo, nọ ndufo edu enyʌñ eforo, uwem ndufo anyʌñ akpeene ke isọñ a-ndufo edatta enie.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Ndufo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />Ami ado mme item, mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo abooho yak ami ikpeep ndufo nọ enam ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaañake Yọdan edidat nnie, <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />mbaak ndufo, nditọ ndufo ye nditọ ammọ eteeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adaña nte ndufo eduuho uwem ke edinịm mme ewʌhọ ye mme item a-ami inọọhọ ndufo, nọ ndufo edu anyan uwem. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Kop, Isrel, nyʌñ kpeme adikop item mmi nọ afọn ye ndufo nọ enyʌñ etọt eti-eti ke isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, akenwọñọ inọọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />Kop, O Isrel: <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado keed.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; me <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi ñnyịn, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado keed; me <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikpọọñ </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Ima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke afịd esịd ndufo ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo ye ke afịd adudu ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Mme mbed se ami inọọ ndufo mfịn ami ana aba ke esịd ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Inam nditọ ndufo ediọọñọ mme mbed ami. Itañ ibaña mme mbed ami ke ini a-ndufo etieghe ke ufọk ye ke ini a-ndufo esañake ke usʌñ, ke ini a-ndufo enaahana ye ke ini a-ndufo edemmeke. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Itobo ammọ nte idiọọñọ ke ubọk ndufo inyʌñ idian ammọ ke akpọiso ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Iwet ammọ ke itịm usʌñufọk ndufo ye ke atob ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaidat ndufo akewuọ isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ mme ete ndufo, anọ Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb, adinọ ndufo, isọñ a-ayọhọke ye mme ikpọ mfọọn abio, a-ndufo imiikibọppọ, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />ufọk a-ayọhọke ye afịd nti ñkpọ a-ndufo imiikibonoke, ube mmọọñ a-ndufo imiikitịppeke, inwañ fain ye inwañ ọlif a-ndufo imiikitọọhọ, ndin ndufo imaidia ñkpọ inyʌñ ikop uyʌkkọ, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />ikpeme ke ndufo ifreke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-akesioho ndufo akpọñ isọñ Iyib, asio ke isọñ ufʌn.<verse eid="DEU 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Iteeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, inam ñkpọ inọ anye ikpọọñ inyʌñ idat unwọñọ ke anyịñ amọ. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Ikiikeene mme abasi mfen, mme abasi mbon e-edʌññọ ikanna ndufo ekʌk; <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-abaaha ye ndufo, ado Abasi ufịb, ndin iyadesịd amọ ayaakpon eti-eti, ndin anye ayaisobo ndufo asio ke iso isọñ. <verse eid="DEU 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />Ikiidomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idomo kpa naña ekenam ke Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Ikịt ibo ke emenịm mbed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ye mme ewʌhọ ye mme item a-anye inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Inam se inen ye se ifọn ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ afọn ye ndufo, nọ ndufo enyʌñ ekaa ekedat eti isọñ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọ ke unwọñọ anọ mme eteete ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />abịne afịd mme asua ndufo asio, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />Ke ini iso, ayịn mfo amaubịp fiin, “Nsoo ke mme item, mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn akinọọ ndufo ewuọñọ?” <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Dọkkọ anye: “Ñnyịn ikido ifʌn inọ Fero ke Iyib, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaisio ñnyịn ke Iyib ke akpọsọñ ubọk. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Ke iso ñnyịn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọñ mme idiọọñọ ye mme utịppeñkpọ, ñkpoon ye mme aniendịk, ke Iyib ye Fero ye afịd ufọk amọ. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Ado anye amaiben ñnyịn asio do anyʌñ iben ñnyịn adisịn, anyʌñ inọ ñnyịn isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ mme eteete ñnyịn. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amainọ ñnyịn ewʌhọ ate inịm afịd mme mbed ado inyʌñ iteeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, nọ ato do ñnyịn iforo afịd ini inyʌñ idu uwem, kpa naña ado mfịn ami. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Ndin adieke ñnyịn inekkeke inịm mme mbed ami ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, kpa naña anye abo inam, ado adiido adinenido ñnyịn.”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ubịne mme Idịd Nsio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaiben ndufo ika isọñ a-ndufo eyemme edidʌk anyʌñ abịn mme uwak idịd asio: mbon Hed, mbon Keekasi, mbon Amọọ, mbon Kenan, mbon Peris, mbon Hif ye mbon Yebus, idịd itiaba ekponno enyʌñ enie adudu ikan ndufo <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaayaak ammọ isịn ndufo ke ubọk, ndin ndufo ekan ammọ, ana ndufo esobo ammọ afịd-afịd. Ikiidʌk edioomo ndomokeed ye ammọ, ikiinyʌñ itua ammọ mbọm. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Ikiidudọiyọ ke atu ammọ. Ikiiyak nditọ ibaan ndufo edọ nditọ ideen ammọ, ikiinyʌñ idọ nditọ ibaan ammọ inọọ nditọ ideen ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />sia ammọ eyaenam nditọ ndufo ewọññọ ekpọñ adiñkpono miin ekappa ekpono mme abasi mfen, ndin iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaafiop ye ndufo anyʌñ isobo ndufo usọp-usọp. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Se ana ndufo enam ammọ ado ami: Ibom mme akpokoro uwa ammọ, ibom ndisana itiad ammọ, ikpeeñe mme abai Asera ammọ inịm ke isọñ inyʌñ ifọp mme usọsọi ñkpọ ammọ ke ikañ. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Sia ndufo edo adisana ibon enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo imek ndufo ke atu afịd mme awo ke iso isọñ nọ ndufo edo asaña-asaña ñkpọuto amọ.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikimaaha ndufo inyʌñ imek ndufo sia emaewak ekan mbon mfen, sia ndufo ekesịp ekan ke atu mme idịd mfen. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Ado akedo sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaima ndufo anyʌñ anịm enwọñọ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ mme eteete ndufo anam anye akisio ndufo ke akpọsọñ ubọk anyʌñ ifak ndufo asio ke isọñ ufʌn, asio ke adudu Fero adidem Iyib. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Idiọọñọ ndin ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ado Abasi; anye ado anam akpanikọ Abasi, anịm edioomo ima amọ tutu mme emana tọsịn mbon e-emaaha anye enyʌñ enịm mme mbed amọ. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Ado</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 7:10">mbon esuaha anye, anye ayaasio ammọ utịb ke iso ammọ ke nsobo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 7:10">Anye idiikpeeneke adisio usiene ye mbon e-esuaha anye ke iso ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Ke ntoro, ikpeme inyʌñ ikịt ke emenịm mme item, mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />Adieke ndufo ekpañña utọñ enọọ mme mbed ami enyʌñ ekpeme adinam ammọ, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaanịm edioomo ima ye ndufo, kpa naña anye akenwọñọ anọ mme eteete ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Anye ayaima ndufo anyʌñ idiọñ ndufo anyʌñ anam ndufo etọt ke ibad. Anye ayaadiọñ mfịd idịb ndufo, ñkpọ inwañ ke isọñ ndufo, abakpa ndufo, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif, mme ñyịn enañ ke atu udịmenañ ndufo ye ñyịn edọñ ke atu udịmedọñ ndufo ke isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ mme eteete ndufo adinọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Eyaidiọñ ndufo ekan afịd mbon mfen; ibaaha awo ke atu ideen me ibaan ndufo a-adiido ada, inyʌññọ iba ufene ndufo i-imiiduakka inie ñyịn. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ndufo ebọkkọ afịd udọñọ. Anye idiiyakka ndiọi udọñọ isịm ndufo. Anye idiiyakka mme ndiọi udọñọ a-ndufo ekediọọñọke ke Iyib isịm ndufo, ado anye ayaanam mme ndiọi udọñọ ado abịne afịd mbon se isua ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Ana ndufo esobo afịd mbon se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo isịn ndufo ke ubọk. Ikiitua ammọ mbọm ikiinyʌñ ikpono mme abasi ammọ, sia adiido ñkpọ ñkpahaukod inọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />Ndufo emekeme ibo idem ndufo ete, “Mme idịd emi e-ekop uko ikan ñnyịn. Ñnyịn idiinam die ibịne ammọ isio?” <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Ado ikiibaak ammọ; itoiyo se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akenam Fero ye afịd Iyib. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Ndufo emaekịt ke anyen ndufo mme akpọsọñ idomo, mme idiọọñọ ye mme utịppeñkpọ, ye akpọsọñ ubọk ye edinyan ubọk, <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akedatta isio ndufo. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaanam ukem ado ye afịd mbon a-ndufo efegheke idahami. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Ke aboiyoke ado, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaadọñ ataad abịne ammọ tutu mbon se idu uwem e-edịbeke ke iso ndufo ekpañña. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Ikiifeghe ammọ, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-abaaha ke atu ndufo, ado ekamba ye anie ndịk Abasi. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaabịne mme idịd ado usʌk-usʌk asio ke iso ndufo. Idiifọnnọ ndufo edibịne ammọ nsịññe akañ keed, imiidooho ntoro mme ndiọi unam eyaikanna ndufo ekʌk. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaayaak ammọ asịn ke ubọk ndufo, asịn ekamba ndutịme ke atu ammọ tutu esobo ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Anye ayaayaak ndidem ammọ isịn ndufo ke ubọk, ndin ndufo eyaesọọk anyịñ ammọ esio ke iso isọñ. Awo ndomokeed idiikanna ndufo; ndufo eyaesobo ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Ana efọp mme usọsọi abasi ammọ ke ikañ. Ikiisịn anyen ke mme silfa ye kold ke idem ammọ, ikiinyʌñ idat mme ñkpọ ado inọọ idem ndufo, imiidooho ntoro ayaado ñkpọ ñkpahaukod inọ ndufo, sia ado mbubiam ñkpọ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Ikiidat mbubiam ñkpọ isịn ke ufọk ndufo, imiidooho ntoro, ndufo ye ñkpọ ado, eyaekịt nsobo. Idat anye nte ataa mbubiam ñkpọ, inekke isua anye, sia esosio anye enịm enọ nsobo.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ikiifre <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />Ikpeme edikeene afịd item se ami inọọ ndufo mfịn ami, nọ ndufo edu enyʌñ etọt ndin enyʌñ edʌk edat isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke adinọ mme ete ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Itoiyo naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akidat ndufo tọọñọ ke anaan ke isua aba ami, adinam ndufo esuuhọ idem anyʌñ idomo ndufo nọ anye adiọọñọ se isịne ke esịd ndufo, me ndufo eyaenịm me idiinịmme mme item amọ. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Anye amaisuuhọ ndufo anịm, anam ndufo ekop abiọọñ ndin anye inọ ndufo mana edia, a-adooho ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo ikidiọọñọke, nọ ikpeep ndufo ke awo iduuho uwem ke uyo ikpọọñ ado ke afịd ikọ se ito inua <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iwuọ. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Afọñ ndufo ikitahake, ñko ukod ndufo ikifuudo ke isua aba ami. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Idiọọñọ ndin ke esịd ndufo ke kpa naña ete atʌnọ ayịn amọ, kpa ntoro ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo itʌnọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Ikpeme mme item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, isaña ke ñkobitem inyʌñ iteeñe anye. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaiben ndufo adisịn ke eti isọñ, isọñ mmọọñ, idịm, ye mmọọñ a-asakkake akedʌk mme abedeñ ye mme abod; <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />isọñ a-anieghe abakpa ye baali, fain ye mme eto fik, mme pomekrened, adan ọlif ye adanakwọọk; <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />isọñ a-adooho uyo idinanake ndin ndufo idiinanake ñkpọ ndomokeed; isọñ a-adooho mme itiad edo ukwak ndin ndufo emekeme idọk kọpa nsio ke mme abod.<verse eid="DEU 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Ndufo imaidia inyʌñ ikop uyʌkkọ, itooro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke eti isọñ a-anye inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Ikịt ibo ke ndufo ifreke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, itreke edinam mme item, mme mbed ye mme ewʌhọ amọ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Imiidooho ntoro, imaidia inyʌñ ikop uyʌkkọ, ibọp mme mfọọn ufọk inyʌñ idʌñọ, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />ndin ke mme ufene ndufo emaekpoon ndin mme silfa ye kold ndufo ewak ndin afịd se ndufo enie etọt, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />ndin esịd ndufo eyaetọọñọ edikịt idem ndin ndufo efre <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, akisioho ndufo ke Iyib, asio ke isọñ ufʌn. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Anye akidat ndufo asaña ke akpa ye aniendịk anaan, isọñ unana mmọọñ ye nsaditọñ, ye ndiọi udʌkikọd ye mme ikpeyen. Anye akesio mmọọñ ke nsaad itiad inọọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Anye inọ ndufo mana nọ eta ke anaan, ñkpọ se mme eteete ndufo imiikidiọọñọke, adinam ndufo esuuhọ idem anyʌñ idomo ndufo ase nọ ato do ke utịd anye adiifọn ye ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Ndufo emekeme edibo idem ndufo ete, “Adudu mmi ye ukeme ubọk mmi anwana inie ami annọọ miin.” <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Ado itoiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, sia anye ado andinọọ ndufo ukeme edinwana ñkpọ, anyʌñ asọọñọ edioomo a-anye akenwọñọke anọ mme ete ndufo, kpa naña ado mfịn.<verse eid="DEU 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Adieke ndufo efreke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ndin ekeene mme abasi mfen enyʌñ ekpono enyʌñ etuak iwuod enọ ammọ, ami mmedo ntiense inọ ndufo mfịn ami mbo ke akpanikọ eyaisobo ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesobo mme idịd e-ekebaaha mbemiso ndufo, kpa ntoro ke ediisobo ndufo ke editre edikop item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Idooho ke Ntak Adinenido Mbon Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />Kop, Isrel: Idahami ndufo eyaekaaña Yọdan eboiyo ekaa enyʌñ ekebịn mme idịd e-ekpoono enyʌñ ekop adudu ikan ndufo, ye mme ñkpoon abio e-enieñeke ndibene akewuọ ikpaanyọñ. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Mbon ado ekop uko enyʌñ edunyọñ, mbon Anak! Ndufo emekop etob ammọ emenyʌñ ekop naña ebo ete: “Anie ikan adika ekọñ ye mbon Anak?” <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Ado nekke sọọñọ kop mfịn ami ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ado andiboiyo iso inọọ ndufo nte ikañ nsobo. Anye ayaasobo ammọ; anye ayaasuuhọ ammọ ke iso ndufo. Ndin ndufo eyaebịn ammọ esịññe enyʌñ esobo ammọ, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọ inọọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />Ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaabịne ammọ isio ke iso mfo, kuubo idem mfo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amben miin adi mmi adinnọ isọñ ami nte udeeme ke ntak adinenido mmi.” Iyoo, idooho ntoro, ado ke ntak ibak mme idịd ami ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiibịne ammọ isio inọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Idooho ke ntak adinenido ndufo me ke eti edu ndufo ke ndufo ediidat isọñ ammọ inie; ado ado ke ntak idiọọk ido mme idịd ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaabịne ammọ asio inọ ndufo, nọ enwọñọ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ ete ndufo, Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb, asu. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Yak anekke inwaña, ndin, ke idooho ke adinenido ndufo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọ ndufo eti isọñ ami edidat nnie, sia ndufo edo mbon esọññọ aboditọñ.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñyịn Enañ Kold</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Itoiyo ami ndin ikiifre naña ndufo ekenam esịd ayat <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke anaan. Tọọñọ ke usen a-ndufo ekekpọññọ Iyib tutu ndufo ediwuọ mmi, ndufo emesọñ iwuod ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Ke Họreb ndufo emaedemme ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nọ anye ayat esịd tutu anye isobo ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Ini a-ami ñkedọọhọ abod adikibọ mme itiadñwed, mme itiadñwed edioomo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenamma ye ndufo, ami mmaaba ke abod usen aba ye akonayio aba; ñkediaha ñkpọ ñnyʌññọ ñnwọñ mmọọñ ndomokeed. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amannọ miin itiadñwed iba e-ekewette ke nnuunubọk Abasi. Ke mme itiadñwed ado ke ekewet afịd mme item <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akinọọhọ ndufo ke abod ato ke ikañ, ke usen mbono.<verse eid="DEU 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Ke utịd usen aba ye akonayio aba, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amannọ itiadñwed iba ado, itiadñwed edioomo. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amandọkkọ miin ate, “Tịkke inikeed kpọñ itie ami, sia mbon mfo a-afo akekoonoke asio ke Iyib enam mbubiam. Ammọ esọsọp ewọññọ ekpọñ usʌñ se ñkewuuk ammọ mbo enam, enyʌñ enam ubobodñkpọ enọ idem ammọ.”<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Ami mmekịt ibon ami, ndin ammọ edo mbon e-esọññọ aboditọñ eti-eti! <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Nsaana miin yaak, nọ ñkan nsobo ammọ ñnyʌñ nsọọk ammọ nsio ke idak anyọñ. Ndin ami ñyaanam afo ado idịd a-asọññọ adudu anyʌñ awak akan ammọ.”<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Ndin ami mmaawọññọ ntịkke ke abod ke idaha akesʌkkọ asak ikañ. Ndin mme itiadñwed edioomo iba ado mmọ ke ubọk mmi ekeba. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Ami ñkese, mmaakịt ke ndufo emaenam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo; ndufo emaenam ubobodñkpọ ke mbid ñyịn enañ. Ndufo emaewọññọ usọp-usọp ekpọñ usʌñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akebooho ndufo esaña. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Ndin ami mmaakoono mme itiadñwed iba ado ke ubọk mmi, ammọ enyʌñ eboomo mbai mbai ke iso ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Ndin ini keed mfen ami mmaanyanna nnaa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke usen aba ye akonayio aba; ndiaha ñkpọ ñnyʌññọ ñnwọñ mmọọñ, ke ntak afịd idiọọkñkpọ a-ndufo ekenamma, enam se idiọọk ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin enam anye ayat esịd. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Ndịk amammʌm abaña iyadesịd ye ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia anye amaayat esịd akem se anye isobo ndufo. Ado ini keed mfen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakpañ utọñ annọ miin. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd tutu ye Erọn akem se akpesobo anye, ado ke ini ado ami mmaabọñ akam nnọ Erọn ñko. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Ndin ami mmaaben idiọọkñkpọ ndufo ado, ubobod ñyịn enañ ndufo ado, mfọp anye ke ikañ. Ndin ami mmaakọk anye tutu anye aforo ntọñ ndin ntop ntọñ ado nsịn ke idịm akefegheke asọiyọ ekamba abod.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Ndufo emaenyʌñ enam <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayat esịd ke Tabera, ke Masa ye Kibrod Hatafa.<verse eid="DEU 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Ndin idaha <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akebịnne ndufo asio ke Kades Banie, anye amaabo, “Dọọk kaa ke dat udeeme isọñ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo.” Ado ndufo emaesọñ iwuod ke item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ndufo ikibuọttọ idem ye anye, inyʌññọ ikop item amọ. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Ndufo esʌk esọọsọñ iwuod ye Abọọñ tọọñọ ami ñkidiọọñọke ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Ami ñkenyaanyanna nnaa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> usen aba ye akonayio aba ado sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo ke iyaisobo ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Ami mmaabọñ akam nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nte, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, kuusobo ikọd mfo, ataa udeemeñkpọ mfo a-afo akefakka ye ekamba adudu anyʌñ asio ke Iyib ke akpọsọñ ubọk. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Toiyo mme awo mfo Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb. Kuuse nsọñiwuod ibon ami, idiọọk ido ye idiọọkñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Imiidooho ntoro, idịd a-afo akisioho ñnyịn ato eyaebo, ‘Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikikanna iben ammọ ikiwuọ isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ ammọ, ndin sia anye amaasua ammọ, anye amaasio ammọ adi nọ adiwoot ammọ ke anaan.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Ado ammọ edo mbon mfo, udeemeñkpọ mfo a-afo akesioho ke akpọsọñ adudu mfo ye unyanyanna ubọk mfo.”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Itiadñwed nte ake Akpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Ke ini ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaambo miin ate, “Kap itiadñwed iba mfen kpa naña mme akpa ako ekeba ndin dọọk mbịne ke abod. Ñko nam akebe edioomo eto. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Ami ñyaawet ke itiadñwed mme ikọ se ikiwere ke mme akpa itiadñwed a-afo akeboomo. Ndin ana afo akoono ammọ adọñ ke akebe edioomo.”<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Ndin ami mmaakama eto akasia ndiọñ akebe edioomo ñnyʌñ ñkap itiadñwed iba nte mme akpa ado, ñnyʌñ ñkedọọk ekamba abod ye mme itiadñwed iba ado ke ubọk mmi. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawet ke itiadñwed se anye akewet akpa, mme Item Duob a-anye aketañña inọọ ndufo ke abod, ke ikañ ke usen mbono. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaak ammọ annọ miin. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Ndin ami mmaasọiyọ ke abod ñnyʌñ nsịn mme itiadñwed ado ke akebe edioomo añkekappa, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akentemme, ndin ammọ mmọdo edọñọ tutu idahami.<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />(Mbon Isrel emaesaña eto ke ube Bene Yaakan tutu ke Mosera. Erọn amaakpa ke ndo emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye, ndin Eliasa ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte aku. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Tọọñọ ke ndo ammọ emaenam isañ ekaa Kudkoda, ndin eboiyo ekaa Yọtbata, isọñ ye mme idịm mmọọñ. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Ke ini ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasio esiin Lifai asaña-asaña anịm nọ eben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, edida ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enam ñkpọ enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ enọ adidiọñ ke anyịñ amọ, kpa naña esʌk enam tutu mfịn. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Ado ado ntak ubon Lifai inieghe udeeme me udeemeñkpọ ke atu mbon Isrel; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado udeemeñkpọ ammọ, naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akedọkkọ ammọ.)<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Ndin ami mmaaba ke abod usen aba ye akonayio aba, kpa naña ñkenam ke akpa ini, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakpañ utọñ annọ miin ke ini ami ñko. Ikidooho uduak amọ adisobo ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Kaa, ndin dat mbon ami usʌñ, nọ ammọ ekedʌk edat isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke nnọ mme eteete ammọ adinọ ammọ enie.”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Teeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />Ndin idahami, Isrel, nsoo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayem ito ndufo akan aditeeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, adisaña ke ñkobitem nnọọ anye, adima anye, adinam ñkpọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke afịd esịd ndufo ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />ñnyʌñ nnịm mme item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme ewʌhọ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ke ufọn ndufo?<verse eid="DEU 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anie mme hefịn, ataa mme ñkoññkan hefịn, ederimbod ye afịd se idọñọ ke esịd. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaama mme eteete ndufo, anye amaimek ndufo, mme ubon ammọ, akan afịd mme idịd mfen, kpa naña ado mfịn ami. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Ndin ikappa esịd ikeene Abasi ndufo ke adinịm mme mbed ammọ, ikiinyʌñ isọñ iwuod aba. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ado Abasi mme abasi ye Abọọñ mme mbọọñ, akwa Abasi, akpon anyʌñ anie ndịk, Abasi i-imiiwọttọ ubakka, inyʌññọ ibọ ubọk edem. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Anye anwana ekọñ iwuod nditọakpa ye ake ebekpa, anyʌñ ama asenawo a-adʌññọ ye ndufo, anọ ammọ ndidia ye afọñ. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Ndin ana ndufo ema mme adidʌñ, sia ndufo emaedo adidʌñ ke Iyib. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Iteeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inyʌñ inam ñkpọ inọ anye. Isọñ ubọk imʌm anye ikama inyʌñ idat unwọñọ ndufo ke anyịñ amọ. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Anye ke ana etooro; anye ado Abasi ndufo, akenamma mme ikpọ ye utịppeñkpọ a-ndufo ekekịtte ke anyen ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Mme eteete ndufo e-ekekaaha Iyib ekedo ata mme duob, ndin idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anam ndufo emewak nte ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ima Inyʌñ Ikop Item Inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Ima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inyʌñ inam se anye ayem, mme ewʌhọ amọ, mme mbed amọ ye mme item amọ afịd ini. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Itoiyo mfịn ke idooho nditọ ndufo ekekịt enyʌñ ebọ ntʌnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo: uku amọ, akpọsọñ ubọk amọ, adinyanna ubọk amọ; <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />mme idiọọñọ ye mme ñkpọ a-anye akenamma ke esịd Iyib, ye Fero adidem Iyib ye afịd idịd amọ, <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />se anye akenam udịmekọñ Iyib, tutu akewuọ mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd, naña anye akefuuk ammọ ye mmọọñ Ndad-Ndad Akpainyañ idaha a-ammọ ekibịneke ndufo, ñko naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesobo ammọ ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Idooho nditọ ndufo ekekịt se anye akenam ke anaan tutu ndufo edisịm itie ami, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />ndin se anye akenam Datan ye Abiram, nditọ ideen Eliab awo ubon Rubịn, ke ini isọñ akekpịkkeke ke ufọọd afịd iso Isrel anyʌñ amen ammọ ye afịd ufọk ammọ, mme atayad ammọ ye afịd ñkpọ se inie uwem e-ekedooho ake ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Ado anyen ndufo akekịt afịd mme ñkpoon ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />Ke ntoro ikpeme afịd item a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami, nọ ndufo enie adudu adika ñkedat isọñ a-ndufo ekaañake Yọdan adikiben nnie, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />ñko nọ ndufo edu anyan uwem ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke adinọ mme eteete ndufo ye mme ubon ammọ, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Isọñ a-ndufo edʌkkọ adikidat ibaaha nte isọñ Iyib, a-ndufo etooho edi, a-ndufo eketọọhọ ñkpasi ndufo enyʌñ ekama ukod eduọk mmọọñ nte inwañ mfañ afere. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Ado isọñ a-ndufo eyemme edikaaña Yọdan mboiyo ñkedat nnie ado abod-abod isọñ ye abedeñ a-asideppe edịm ato anyọñ. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Ado isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akereke ñkpọ abaña; anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo asʌk awʌhọ do tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ isua tutu utịd.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Adieke ndufo enekkeke enịm mme item a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami, adima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ñnyʌñ nnam ñkpọ nnọọ anye ke afịd esịd ndufo ye afịd ukpọñ ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />ndin ami ñyaanam edịm adep ke isọñ ndufo ke akemini amọ, akpa edịm ye akpeedem edịm, nọ ndufo edọk idọk abakpa ndufo, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Ami ñyaanọ mme enañ ndufo mbid, ndin ndufo eyaedia enyʌñ ekop uyʌkkọ.<verse eid="DEU 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Ado ikpeme mbaak editap ndufo nọ ewọññọ ekekpono enyʌñ etuak iwuod enọ mme abasi mfen. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Ndin iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaawọññọ ise ndufo, ndin anye ayaasiit anyọñ mbaak edịm adidep, ndin isọñ idiinwịmme mfịd, ndufo eyaenyʌñ etak ke eti isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Inekke itʌm isịn mme ikọ mmi ami ke esịd ye akikere ndufo; itobo ammọ nte idiọọñọ ke ubọk ndufo, inyʌñ ibọp ammọ ke akpọiso ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Ikpeep nditọ ndufo mme mbed ami, itañ ibaña mme mbed ami ke ini ndufo etieghe ke ufọk ye ke ini ndufo esañake ke usʌñ, ke ini ndufo enaahana ye ke ini ake ndufo edemmeke. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Iwet ke mme abọbọọk anyenusʌñ ufọk ndufo ye ke mme inuaatob ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />nọ usen uwem ndufo ye ake nditọ ndufo ewak ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke adinọ mme eteete ndufo, kpa naña mme usen a-mme anyọñ ekoñño ekan isọñ.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Adieke ndufo enekkeke ekpeme edinịm mme item a-ami inọọhọ ndufo, adima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, esaña ke ñkobitem amọ, enyʌñ efat anye ekama, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaabịne afịd mme idịd ami asio inọ ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaebọ mme idịd se ikpon inyʌñ ikop uko ikan ndufo itie enie. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Afịd itie se ndufo edot ukod adiido ake ndufo: efaak ndufo ayaatọọñọ ke Lebanọn, ye Inyañ Yufretis akewuọ Inyañ Mediterenia. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Awo ndomokeed idiikanna ida ndufo ke iso. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, kpa naña anye akenwọñọ inọọ, ayaanam ammọ ekop ndịk enyʌñ ibaak ndufo ke afịd isọñ a-ndufo ekaahaka.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Kap se, ami mmenịm adidiọñ ye isuuñọ ke iso ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />adidiọñ adieke ndufo ekoppo mme item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami; <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />isuuñọ adieke ndufo etreke adikop mme item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ ewọññọ ekpọñ usʌñ a-ami iwuuhọ ndufo mfịn ami ekekeene mme abasi mfen, a-ndufo imiidiọọñọke. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaisio ndufo idisịn ke isọñ a-ndufo edʌkkọ adidat nnie, ana ndufo esọọñọ mme adidiọñ ado ke Abod Kerisịm, ye mme isuuñọ ado ke Abod Ebal. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Kpa naña ediọọñọ, mme ñkpoon abod ami eba ke edem Yọdan, ke usobutịn, ekpere mme ñkpoon eto Mọre, ke efaak mbon Kenan e-edʌñọke ke Araba ekpere Kilkal. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Ndufo eyaekaaña Yọdan edʌk enyʌñ edat isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo. Ke ini ndufo emaekedat anye enie enyʌñ edʌñọ do, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />ikịt ibo ke emenịm afịd ewʌhọ ye mme mbed a-ami nnịmme ke iso ndufo mfịn ami.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s1">Itie Ukpono Keed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed a-anaaha ndufo enekke enịm ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, inọọhọ ndufo edat enie, adaña nte ndufo edʌñọke ke isọñ ado ado ami. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Ibiat ataa afịd-afịd mme itie ke mme anyọñ ikpọabod, ke ntək abod ye ke idak ntatara eto, a-mme idịd andufo ebọọhọ ammọ isọñ esikamake ekpono mme abasi ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Iwuut mme itieukpono ammọ, iboom mme itiad uwa ammọ, inyʌñ ifọọmọ mme abai Asera ammọ ke ikañ; ikpok usọsọi ñkpọ mme abasi ammọ, ndin isọọk mme anyịñ ammọ isio ke mme itie ado.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Inaaha ndufo ekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke usʌñ naña ammọ ekpono. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Ado ana ndufo eyem itie se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiimek ke atu afịd mme esiin ndufo adinịm Anyịñ Amọ ke ndo nte itie idʌñ. Itie ado ke ana ndufo eka; <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />ikoono mme ufọfọb enọ ye mme uwa, mme enọ mbaak keed ke itie duob ye mme asaña-asaña enọ, se enwọñọ adinọ ye mme enọ imaesịd, ye akpa uman ye ufene ndufo idi itie ado. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Ndo, ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ndufo ye ufọk ndufo eyaedia enyʌñ edaara ke afịd ñkpọ se esịn ubọk ndufo enam, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idiọñ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Inaaha ndufo enam naña ñnyịn inam mfịn ami, a-adooho afịd awo enam naña ema, naña ekere ebo ke a-anen, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />sia ndufo iwuọhọ itie nduọkadudu ye udeemeñkpọ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Ado ndufo eyaekaaña Yọdan enyʌñ edʌñ ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi inọọhọ ndufo nte udeemeñkpọ, ndin anye ayainọ ndufo nduọkadudu ke ubọk mme asua ndufo e-ekannake ndufo ekʌk nọ ndufo edʌñ ke ifuuro. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Ndin itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiimek nte itie idʌñ inọ Anyịñ Amọ, ke ndo ke ndufo ediikoono afịd ñkpọ se mbo ndufo enam: mme ufọfọb enọ ye mme uwa, mme enọ mbaak keed ke itie duob ye mme asaña-asaña enọ se enwọñọ adinọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Ndin ke itie ado idaara ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ndufo, nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ndufo, nditọufọk ideen ye nditọufọk ibaan ndufo, ye mme Lifai ke mme abio ndufo ammiinieghe ubakka me udeemeñkpọ ake ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Inekke ikpeme, ikiinam ufọfọb enọ ndufo ke itie nte emama. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Inam uwa ke itie nte <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> adiimek ke atu esiin ndufo, ke ndo, inam afịd se ami mbo yak ndufo enam.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Kpayeado, ndufo emekeme ediyọọk mme unam ndufo ke abio ndufo akeedodo enyʌñ eta unam ado naña ndufo emama edita, nte akpedooho edob me ebed, akeene adidiọñ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọ. Mbon se isana ye mbon se imiisanake ekeme edita anye. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Ado inaaha ndufo eta iyiib ado; yak eduọk iyiib ado ke isọñ nte mmọọñ. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Ke mme abio a-ndufo inaaha edia mme mbaak keed ke itie duob abakpa ye ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif, me akpa uman mme ufene ndufo, me ñkpọ akeedodo a-ndufo enwọñọke edinọ, me mme enọ imaesịd me mme asaña-asaña enọ. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Utu ke ado, ana ndufo edia mme ñkpọ ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiimek: ndufo, nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ndufo, nditọufọk ideen ye nditọufọk ibaan ndufo, ye mme Lifai ke mme abio ndufo; ndin ana ndufo edaara ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke afịd ñkpọ se ndufo enam. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Inekke ikpeme mbaak ndufo idifre mme Lifai adaña nte ndufo edʌñọke ke isọñ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaatat adaña ndufo kpa naña anye akenwọñọ, ndin ndufo ewʌrọ unam enyʌñ ebo, “Ami ñkpaama unam,” ndin ndufo emekeme edita naña eyem. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Adieke itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amekke adiwet Anyịñ amọ anyọọñọ usʌñ ikpọñ ndufo abọhọ, ndufo emekeme ediwot mme unam eto atu udịmenañ ye udịmedọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> inọọhọ ndufo, kpa naña ami itemme ndufo, ye ke mme abio ndufo emekeme edita naña ndufo ekpeyeyem edita. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Ita ammọ naña ekpeta edob me ebed. Mbon awo se imiisanake ye mbon se isana ekeme edita. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Ado ikịt ibo ke ndufo itaaha iyiib, sia iyiib ado uwem, ndin inaaha ndufo edian uwem eta ye unam. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Ndufo ñko inaaha eta iyiib; iduọk anye ke isọñ nte mmọọñ. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Ikiidia anye, nọ afọn ye ndufo ye nditọ ndufo, sia ke ntoro ndufo eyaenam se ifọn ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="DEU 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Ado iben mme ndisana ñkpọ ndufo ye mme ñkpọ akeedodo a-ndufo enwọñọke edinọ, ndin ikaa ke itie se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiimek. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Iben mme ufọfọb enọ ndufo, abʌkunam ye iyiib, ikaa ke itieukpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ana eduọk iyiib mme uwa ndufo ke mben itieukpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ado emekeme edita unam ado. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Inekke ikpeme edinam afịd mme item a-ami inọọhọ ndufo, nọ afọn ye ndufo afịd ini ye nditọ ndufo, sia ndufo ediinam se inen ye se ifọn ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaasobo mme idịd se ndufo ediikan ubọk inyʌñ idat isọñ ammọ inie. Ado ndufo imaibịne ammọ isio idʌñọ ke isọñ ammọ, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />ndin ke imaikisobo ammọ, ikpeme mbaak edimʌm ndufo ke afia ke ini ebịppe ebaña mme abasi ammọ, ete, “Mme idịd ami ekpono die mme abasi ammọ? Ñnyịn ñko iyainam ukem ado.” <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Inaaha ndufo ekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo naña ammọ ekpono, sia ke edikpono mme abasi ammọ, ammọ enam mme mbubiam ido <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> asuaha. Ammọ efọp nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ammọ ke ikañ nte mme uwa enọ mme abasi ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />Ikịt ibo ke ndufo emenam afịd se ami iwuuk ndufo adinam; ikiidadian, ikiinyʌñ isosio ifep.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru ufañ ami Dit 12:32 ewet Dit 13:1</char></note><verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ukpono Mme Abasi Mfen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru Dit 13:1-18 ekappa ewet Dit 13:2-19. </char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />Adieke prọfed, me awo a-akamake ndab atañ abaña ini iso adiighe ke atu ndufo anyʌñ aditañ idiọọñọ me utịppeñkpọ, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />ndin akpedo idiọọñọ me utịppeñkpọ ado aditịppe, ndin prọfed ado ate, “Yak ñnyịn ikeene mme abasi mfen” (mme abasi a-ndufo imiidiọọñọke) “ndin yak ñnyịn ikpono ammọ,” <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />inaaha ekop ikọ prọfed me adappa ndab ado. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idomo ndufo idomo ase me ndufo emema anye ke afịd esịd ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo kpọd ke ana ekeene, anye kpọd ke ana eteeñe. Inịm mme item amọ inyʌñ ikop item amọ; inam ñkpọ inọ anye inyʌñ ifat anye ikama. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Ana ewot prọfed me adappa ndab ado ke anye adidọọñ ndufo ewọññọ ekpọñ usʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-akisioho ndufo ke isọñ Iyib anyʌñ ifak ndufo ke isọñ ufʌn. Prọfed ado me adappa ndab ado akeyem usʌñ adisio ndufo ñkpọñ usʌñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akiwuuho ndufo abo esaña. Ana esio idiọọkñkpọ ado ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Adieke ataa ayịneka mfo awodeen, me ayịn mfo awodeen me awonwaan, me ataa anwaan a-afo amaaha, me ufan ntandia mfo ke ndịbe-ndịbe utap fiin abo, “Di nọ ñnyịn ika ikikpono mme abasi mfen” (mme abasi a-adooho ndufo me eteete ndufo idiọọñọke, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />mme abasi mbon e-edʌññọ ikanna ndufo, me ke ñkped-ñkped me ke anyan usʌñ, tọọñọ ke utịd isọñ keed tutu akesịm utịd uko), <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />ikiinyịmme ikiinyʌñ ikpañ utọñ inọọ ammọ. Ikiitua ammọ mbọm. Ikiiyaak ammọ ikiinyʌñ idịp ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Ana ewot ammọ. Ubọk mfo ana ado akpa adiwot ammọ ndin ubọk afịd awo ediana. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Itọọñ ammọ ke itiad iwot, sia ammọ ekeyem ediwọññọ ndufo ñkpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-akibenne ndufo asio ke Iyib, ke isọñ ufʌn. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Ndin afịd Isrel eyaekop, ndin ndịk anyʌñ amʌm ammọ, ndin awo ndomokeed idiinamma utọ idiọọkñkpọ ado aba.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Adieke ekoppo naña etañ ebaña keed ke atu mme abio <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiinọ ndufo nọ edʌñọ <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />ke mbon ntịme edakka eda ke atu ndufo enyʌñ edat mbon abio ammọ etịn usʌñ, ete, “Yak ñnyịn ika ikikpono mme abasi mfen” (mme abasi a-ndufo imiidiọọñọke), <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />ndin ana ebịp, eduuñọ ayọhọ-ayọhọ. Ndin akpedo akpanikọ ndin ewọt ke e-enam mbubiam ñkpọ ami ke ufọọd ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />ana ewot afịd awo se idʌñ ke abio ado ke akañkañ. Ana esobo abio ado afịd-afịd, mme awo ye ufene. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Ana ekoono afịd mbịme abio ado eka ke ufọọd asan ndin efọp ataa afịd abio ado ye afịd mbịme nte ufọfọb uwa enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Abio ado ana aba ke nsobo ke nsi-nsi, inaaha emaana ebọp anye, <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />ndin ke ekịt ñkpọ nsobo ndomokeed ke ubọk ndufo. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiikoppo aba ifiobesịd, ayaawọt ima, ayaanyʌñ itua ndufo mbọm. Anye ayaanam ndufo ewak, kpa naña Anye akenwọñọ ke unwọñọ anọ mme eteete ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />sia ndufo emekop item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke edinịm mme item amọ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami enyʌñ enam se ifọn ke anyen amọ.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ndidia se Isana ye Anye I-imiisanake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />Ndufo edo nditọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ikiikpịkke idem ndufo ikiinyʌñ ikwaat iso iwuod ndufo inọọ mme akpañkpa, <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />sia ndufo edo mme ndisana ibon enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ke atu afịd mme awo ke ederimbod, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> imek ndufo adido mme ñkpọuto amọ.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />Ikiidia ñkpọ ndomokeed se ido mbubiam. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Mme unam se ndufo ekeme edita edo ami: ayaaraenañ, edọñ, ebod, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />akoyo, edob, ebed, ebod ikọd, enañ ikọd ye edọñ abod. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Emekeme edita unam akeedodo a-ñkpad asakkake iba anyʌñ akọkkọ ñkpọ amaana ata. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Kpayeado, ke atu afịd se ikọkkọ ñkpọ ita me se inie nsakka ñkpad, inaaha ndufo eta kamel, ekpumbakara me akukọñitiad. Sia akpesʌkado ammọ ekọkkọke ñkpọ eta, ammọ inieghe nsakka ñkpad; ammọ isanake idot se ndufo eta. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Edi ñko isanake; akpesʌkado anye anieghe nsakka ñkpad, ado anye ikọkkọke ñkpọ ita. Inaaha ndufo eta unam amọ, ikiinyʌñ ituuk mme akpo ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Ke atu afịd unam se idʌñ ke mmọọñ, ndufo emekeme edita keed akeedodo a-anieghe mba ye ikpọk. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Ado inaaha eta ñkpọ akeedodo ammiinieghe mba ye ikpọk; idooho adisana inọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Emekeme edita inuen akeedodo a-asanake. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Ado inaaha eta mbon ami: ntrukpuum, utere, abubịd utere, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />ndad-ndad akukwọ, abubịd akukwọ, ye utọ uman ntrukpuum akeedodo, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />sutọ-sutọ ekọọñebʌkayob, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />ñkịdikịd a-anieghe nnʌk, ñkịdikịd abọọñọ ñkpo, inuen inyañ, sutọ-sutọ ndukpo, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />etək ñkịdikịd, ekamba ñkịdikịd, afia ñkịdikịd, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />ñkịdikịd anaan, akukwọ, komoran, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />ikpañinyañ, sutọ-sutọ ikpañinyañ, hupo ye ñkpekpem.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Afịd insek se ifofuuro edo ndek inọ ndufo; ikiita ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Ado unam akeedodo a-anieghe mba ado se isana anyʌñ adot se eta.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Ikiita ñkpọ ndomokeed se ndufo ekịt ke amaakpakpa. Emekeme edinọ mme adidʌñ e-edʌññọ ke mme abio ndufo, ndin ammọ ekeme edita, imiidooho ndufo enyam enọ asenawo mfen. Ado ndufo edo mme ndisana ibon enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Ikiitem ñyịn ebod ke mmọọñeba eka amọ.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Mbakka Keed ke Itie Duob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Ikịt ibo ke emesio mbakka keed ke atu itie duob afịd ñkpọ inwañ ndufo afịd isua. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Idia mbakka keed ke itie duob ñkpọ inwañ ndufo, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif, ye akpa ñyịn ufene ndufo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke itie a-anye adiimek nte itieidʌñ inọ Anyịñ amọ, nọ ndufo ekpeep editeeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo afịd-afịd ini. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Adieke itie ado anyọọñọ usʌñ abọhọ ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idiọñ ndufo ndin ikanna iben mbakka keed ke itie duob (sia itie nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiimek adinịm Anyịñ amọ anyọọñ usʌñ tutu), <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />ndin iben mbakka keed ke itie duob ndufo ikpuuño ye silfa, ndin iben silfa ado ikaa itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiimek. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Idat silfa ado idep se ndufo ekpemama nte: enañ, edọñ, ukọd me utọ ndañ ukọd mfen, me ñkpọ mfen se ndufo ekpemama. Ndin ndufo ye afịd ufọk ndufo eyaedia ke ndo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ edaara. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Ikiinyʌñ ifre mme Lifai e-edʌñọke ke mme abio ndufo, sia ammọ inieghe asaña-asaña udeemeñkpọ ake idem ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Ke utịd afịd isua ita, ikoono afịd mbakka keed ke itie duob mbunwịm isua ado inekke ibono ke mme abio ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />nọ ato do mme Lifai (i-imiinieghe udeemeñkpọ ake idem ammọ) ye mme adidʌñ, nditọakpa ye mme ebekpa e-edʌññọ ke mme abio ndufo ekan edididia ñkpọ enyʌñ ekop uyʌkkọ, ndin ñko nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiidiọñ ndufo ke afịd ubọkutom ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s1">Isua Ubiad mme Isọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />Ke utịd afịd isua itiaba ana ebiat mme isọn efep. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Naña ediinam ado ami: Afịd mme anọọ ewuọd ke akʌk, ana ebiat se utọ ewuọd ammọ ekenọọhọ emọ-emọ awo Isrel efep. Inaaha ammọ edibọ mbon ammọ isọn aba, sia ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adibiat ukpe isọn mfep adikem. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Emekeme edibịp asenawo isọn, ado ana ebiat isọn akeedodo e-emọ-emọ awo Isrel ikamake ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Kpayeado, ibaaha ntak a-mbon uweene ekpebaaha ke atu ndufo, sia ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo nọ edat enie nte udeemeñkpọ ndufo, anye ayaanekke idiọñ ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />adieke ndufo ekappa ekop item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ ekpeme adinam afịd mme item amọ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaidiọñ ndufo kpa naña anye amaakenwọñọ, ndin ndufo eyaenọ uwak mme idịd ewuọd ado ndufo idiiwuọdọ ito awo ammọ ndomokeed. Ndufo eyaekara uwak mme idịd ado ibaaha anye se idiikaara ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />Adieke awo ndomokeed adooho uweene ke atu ndufo mbon Isrel ke mme abio ndomokeed ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo, ikiisọñ esịd ikiinyʌñ ifaam efaam ibaña utọ ibon ado. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Utu ke ado itat ubọk inyʌñ iwuọt ammọ ñkpọ se ammọ eyem ke ntadubọk. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Inekke ikpeme mbaak ndufo idinie akikere ibak ami: “Ayọhọ isua itiaba, isua ubiat isọñ, asʌk akpere,” mbaak ndufo idinie idiọọk akikere ibaña mbon unana ke atu mbon Isrel inyʌññọ inọ ammọ unwam ndomokeed. Ammọ ndin eyaeseeme enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibaña ndufo, ndin eyaekịt ndudue idiọọkñkpọ inọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Inọ ammọ ke ntadubọk, idooho ke ifịkesịd; ndin ke ntak ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaadiọñ afịd utom ndufo ye afịd ñkpọ se ubọk ndufo atuuk. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Mme uweene ediisʌk ibaba ke isọñ. Ke ntoro ami mmiiwuuk ndufo, itat ubọk ifọn mfọn ibaña emọ-emọ mbon Isrel e-edooho uweene enyʌñ eyem unwam ke isọñ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Unọ mme Nditọufọk Ñkpọkñyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Adieke awo ndomokeed ke atu ndufo, ideen me ibaan Hibru, enyamma idem ammọ inọọ ndufo enyʌñ enam ñkpọ inọọ ndufo ke isua itiokeed, ke ayọhọ isua itiaba ana ndufo eyaak ammọ enyọñọ. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Ndin umaukpọk ammọ uyaak, kuunọọ ammọ enyọñọ ubọk ñkaña. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Isio ke atu udịmedọñ ndufo, afe ubeek abakpa ndufo, afe unam ukọd ndufo inọ ammọ ke ntadubọk. Inọ ammọ ikeene naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idiọñ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Itoiyo ke ndufo emaedo ifʌn ke Iyib ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaifak ndufo. Ntak ado anam ami inọ ndufo item ami mfịn ami.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Ado adieke ayịnufọk mfo ubooho fiin ate, “Ami ñyemme adukpọñ fiin,” sia anye uma fiin ye ufọk mfo ndin anyʌñ afọn ye anye adiba ye afo, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />ndin dat akuum tịppe anye utọñ dian ke itịm, ndin anye ayaado ayịnufọk mfo ke nsi-nsi. Nam ukem ado ye ayịnufọk mfo awonwaan.<verse eid="DEU 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Kuudat nte akpọsọñ ñkpọ adisio ayịnufọk mfo unyọñ, sia utom a-ammọ enamma unọọ ke isua itiokeed ado akem akpekpe awo utom akañ iba. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ayaudiọñ fiin ke afịd ñkpọ se anam.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Asiakidịb Ufene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />Sio nịm asaña-asaña nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo afịd asiakidịb ayaara ke atu udịmenañ ye udịmedọñ ndufo. Ikiiyak asiakidịb ke mme umanenañ ndufo anam utom, ikiinyʌñ ikwaat ided asiakidịb edọñ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Kwa isua afo ye ufọk mfo ana eta ammọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke itie a-anye adiimek. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Adieke unam anieghe ndo, ado mbʌñọ me nnan, me anie idiọọk ndo, inaaha adat anye anam uwa anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Ana ndufo eta anye ke mme abio ndufo. Mbon awo se imiisanake ye mbon awo se isana ekeme adita anye, nte akpedo edob me ebed. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Ado inaaha edia iyiib ado; iduọk anye ke isọñ nte mmọọñ.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nsaña Mboiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Inịm afiọñ Afif inyʌñ idia Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, sia ke afiọñ Afif anye amaisio ndufo ke Iyib ke akonayio. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Iwa uwa Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ye unam a-atooho atu ufene ndufo ke itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> adiimek nte itie idʌñ inọ Anyịñ amọ. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Ikiita anye ye uyo esịnne yiis, ado ke afịd usen itiaba ita uyo awo imiisịnne yiis, uyo ukuud, sia ndufo ekekpọñ Iyib itọk-itọk, nọ ndufo etoiyo idaha a-ndufo ekekpọññọ Iyib ke afịd ayio uwem ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Yak ke ekịt yiis ndomokeed ke afịd abio ndufo ke usen itiaba. Ikiinyʌñ iyak unam ndomokeed ayọhọ asʌhọ ke ndubiayio akpa usen tutu ubakusen.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Inaaha ndufo enam uwa Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke abio ndomokeed <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />ibọhọke ke itie se anye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiimek nte itie idʌñ inọ Anyịñ amọ. Ke ndo ke ana ndufo enam uwa Usọrọ Nsaña Mboiyo ke ndubiayio, ke ini utịn amaasuuhọ, ke ini usọrọ aditoiyo ini a-ndufo ekekpọñ Iyib. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Ifọp anye inyʌñ ita ke itie se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiimek. Ndin ke ubakusen itịmme inyọñ mme atayad ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Ita uyo se yiis imiisịneke ke afịd usen itiokeed ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaba ikoot mbono inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ikiinyʌñ inam utom ndomokeed.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usọrọ Mme Udua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />Ibat udua itiaba tọọñọ ke idaha etọọñọke edikpook nsek abakpa ke akọbọ. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Ndin inam idaara Usọrọ Udua inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke edinọ enọ imaesịd ke udomo adidiọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Ndin idaara ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke itie a-anye adiimek nte itie idʌñ inọ Anyịñ amọ, ndufo, nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ndufo, nditọufọk ideen ye nditọufọk ibaan ndufo, mbon Lifai ke mme abio ndufo, mme adidʌñ, nditọakpa ye mme ebekpa e-edʌññọ ke atu ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Itoiyo ke ndufo emaedo ifʌn ke Iyib, inyʌñ inekke inịm mme ewʌhọ ami.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />Idia Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd ke usen itiaba ke ndufo emaekoono afịd abakpa ye ukọd ke afe ubeek abakpa ye afe unyịmme ukọd ibon itie keed. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Inam idaara ke usọrọ ndufo, ndufo, nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ndufo, nditọufọk ideen ye nditọufọk ibaan ndufo, ye mbon Lifai, mme adidʌñ, nditọakpa ye mme ebekpa e-edʌññọ ke abio ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Ke usen itiaba idia idaara inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> adiimek. Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaidiọñ ndufo ke afịd idọk ye ke afịd ubọkutom ndufo, ndin idadesịd ndufo ayaayọhọ.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Akañ ita ke isua afịd ideen ana ekaiso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke itie se anye adiimek: ke Usọrọ Uyo Unana Yiis, Usọrọ mme Udua ye Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd. Inaaha awo ndomokeed asaña ubọk ñkaña aka iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Awo keedekeed ana asaña ye enọ a-akemme ke naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idiọñ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Abiideikpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Imek mme abiideikpe ye ñkpisọñ inọ mme esiin ndufo keedekeed ke afịd abio se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọ ndufo, ndin ammọ eyaekpe ikpe enọ mbon awo ke nnen-nnen usʌñ. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Ikiikpe ukwañ ikpe, ikiinyʌñ ibaak awo anyen. Ikiibọọ ubọkedem, sia ubọkedem akekịm awo aniọñ anyen anyʌñ akwaañ ikọ adinen awo. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Ikeene unen kpa unen kpọd, nọ ndufo edʌñ enyʌñ edat isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo enie.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adikpono mme Abasi Mfen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />Ikiiwuuk abai Asera ikpere itieukpono e-ebọppọ enọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />ikiinyʌñ iwuuk asaña-asaña itiad, sia mme ñkpọ ami ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo asua.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Ikiidat abaakenañ me edọñ a-anieghe ndo inam uwa inọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, sia adiido mbubiam inọ anye.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Adieke ekịtte naña awodeen me awonwaan a-adʌññọ ke atu ndufo ke abio ndufo keed <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> inọọhọ ndufo, anamma idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke adibiat mme edioomo amọ, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />awọññọ akpọñ item mmi, akpono mme abasi mfen, atuak iwuod anọ mme udịmanyọñ e-edooho utịn me afiọñ me ntantaafiọñ ke ikpaanyọñ, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />ndin enam ndufo ediọọñọ, ana ndufo enekke eduuñọ eti-eti. Akpedo akpanikọ ndin enyʌñ ewọt ke e-enam mbubiam adinam ami ke Isrel, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />iben awodeen me awonwaan a-anamma idiọọkñkpọ ami ikaa inuaatob abio inyʌñ ikitọọñ anye ke itiad tutu anye akpa. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Ke ntiense awo iba me ita ke ana nte ewot awo, ado inaaha ewot awo ndomokeed ke ntiense awo keed kpọd. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Ana ubọk mme ntiense edo akpa adiwot awo ado, ndin mbon mfen ediana. Ana ndufo esio idiọọkñkpọ ado ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ufọkesob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Adieke ebenne mme ikpe esọññọ ikan ndufo edikpe edi ke mme ufọkesob ndufo, me uwodawo, utọk me anwan, iben ammọ ikaa itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiimek. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Ikaa ibịne mme aku Lifai ye abiideikpe a-abaaha ke utom idaha ado. Ibịp ammọ, ndin ammọ eyainọ ndufo ubiideikpe. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Ana ndufo enam ekeene se ammọ ebiere ke itie se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiimek. Ikpeme edinam afịd se ammọ ebo ndufo enam. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Inam ikeene se adodo a-ammọ ikpeebe ye mme ubiere a-ammọ enọọhọ. Ikiiwọññọ ikpọñ se ammọ itemme, ke nnasia me ke ufiin. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Ana ewot awo akeedodo a-amiommo abiideikpe me aku a-adaaha anam utom anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ana esio idiọọkñkpọ ado ke Isrel. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Afịd awo eyaekop enyʌñ enie ndịk ebaña, inyʌññọ inam emiom aba.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />Ndufo emaedʌk isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ inyʌñ idat inie ndin edʌñọ ke esịd amọ, ndin ndufo ete, “Yak ñnyịn inie adidem se ikara ñnyịn kpa naña mme idịd ikannake ñnyịn ekʌk enie,” <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />ikịt ibo ke ememek adidem <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amekke. Ana anye ado awo Isrel. Ikiinịm asenawo nọ ikara ndufo, awo i-imiidooho awo Isrel. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Ñko, adidem ado inaaha anie uwak-uwak enañmbakara ke idem amọ me anam ndufo etịmme eka Iyib ekekoono uwak-uwak enañmbakara mfen, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo i-idọkkọ ndufo, “Inaaha ndufo etịmme eka usʌñ ado aba.” <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Inaaha anye adọ uwak ibaan, imiidooho esịd amọ ayaatịmede. Inaaha anye anie uwak-uwak silfa ye kold.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Anye amaadọọk ebekpo ubọọñ amọ, ana anye awet anọ idem amọ ke ñwed mfen mme mbed ami, a-atooho mme aku Lifai. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Ana aba ye anye, ndin ana anye akoot anye afịd ayio uwem amọ nọ anye akpeep aditeeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ anyʌñ anekke akeene afịd ikọ mbed ye mme ewʌhọ ami <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />inyʌññọ ikịt idem amọ nte imifọn ikan emọ-emọ mbon Isrel, ñnyʌñ ñwọññọ ñkpọñ mbed ñkaa nnasia me ufiin. Ndin anye ye ubon amọ eyaekara ke anyan isua ke ebekpo amọ ke Isrel.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Enọ E-enọọhọ mme Aku ye mme Lifai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />Mme aku ubon Lifai, kpa ye afịd esiin Lifai inaaha enie udeemeñkpọ ye Isrel. Ammọ ediidu uwem ke mme enọ mbunwịm e-enọọhọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia anye ado ado udeemeñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Ammọ idiinieghe udeemeñkpọ ke atu emọ-emọ mbon Isrel; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado udeemeñkpọ ammọ, naña anye akenwọñọ anọ ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Anyem ado udeeme a-anieghe mme aku a-atooho mbon se iwa ayaaraenañ me edọñ: afara, mme ñkpọ esịd idịb ye unam a-atooho iwuod. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Ana enọ ammọ mme akpa mfịd abakpa ndufo, ufa ukọd ye adan ọlif, ye akpa ided e-efatta eto edọñ ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo a-amek ammọ ye ubon ammọ ke atu mme esiin ndufo edida nnam ñkpọ ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afịd-afịd ini.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Adieke awo Lifai akpọññọ abio nte keed ke Isrel a-anye akebaaha, adidi ke afịd esịd akpanikọ itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> adiimek, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />anye akeme adinam utom ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ kpa naña mme emọ-emọ Lifai enam utom do ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Ana anye akeene awuana ukem-ukem ke mme ñkpọ e-enọọhọ ammọ, akpọkọm anye amaabọ akʌk ato ke adinyam ñkpọ ufọk amọ.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adinam Mbon Ifọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />Imaikidʌk isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo, ikiikpeep mme mbubiam eduuwem mme idịd ke udo. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Inaaha ekịt awo ndomokeed ke atu ndufo a-awaaha ayịn awodeen me ayịn awonwaan amọ ke ikañ, a-anamma utom abiaidiọñ me abiamfa, a-akappake ñkukịd, a-abreke ifọd, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />me a-atọọhọ awo ñkpeñanyeñ, akịdñkukịd me abiaekpo. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Awo akeedodo a-anamma mme edinam ami atek <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd; kpa ke ntak mme mbubiam ido ami ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiibịne mme idịd ado isio ke iso ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Ana ndufo enana ndo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Prọfed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Mme idịd se ndufo idiibịn isio ekpañ utọñ enọ mbon se ibre idiọñ me useñkpọ. Ado amaado ndufo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inyịmmeke ndufo enam ntoro. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaasio prọfed a-abaaha nte ami ke atu ndufo, emọ-emọ awo Isrel. Ana ndufo ekpañ utọñ enọ anye. <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Sia se ndufo ekebeeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke Họreb ke usen mboho idaha a-ndufo ekebooho, “Yak ñnyịn ikiikop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, ikiinyʌñ ikịt ekamba ikañ ami aba, imiidooho ñnyịn iyaikpa.”<verse eid="DEU 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin: “Se ammọ etañ a-afọn. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Ami ñyaasio prọfed a-abaaha nte afo ke atu mbon Isrel nnọ ammọ, ndin ami ñyaasịn mme ikọ mmi ke inua amọ. Anye ayaadọkkọ ammọ afịd ñkpọ se ami ñwuuk anye mbo atañ. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Ami ke idem mmi ñyaabịp awo i-imiikpañña utọñ ikop mme ikọ se prọfed ado atañ ke anyịñ mmi. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Ado prọfed a-akamake anyịñ mmi atañ se ami mmentemmeke, me prọfed a-adatta anyịñ mme abasi mfen atañ, ana ewot anye.”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Ndufo emekeme edibo idem ndufo ete, “Ñnyịn idiinam die idiọọñọ ini e-etob imiitooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?” <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Adieke se prọfed atañ ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> imiitịppeke inyʌññọ ido akpanikọ, idooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ etob anye ado. Prọfed anye ado atañ ikọ idem amọ, ke ntoro ikiiyak idem inyeñ.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Abio Udịbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />Ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaasobo mme idịd e-enieghe isọñ a-anye adiinọ ndufo, ndin ndufo imaibịne ammọ isio inyʌñ idʌñ ke mme abio ye mme ufọk ammọ, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />idiañña abio ita inịm ke isọñ ado <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ edat enie. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Idiọọñọ naña isọñ edunyọñ inyʌñ ibakka isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ nte udeemeñkpọ ke itie ita, nọ ato do awo a-awotto awo akeme ifeghe akedịbe ke keed ke atu mme abio ado.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mbed a-abañake awo akeedodo a-awotto awo ndin afeghe akpọñ ndo nọ abọkkọ ado ami, awo ndomokeed i-imiifiọkọfiọk iwot mbọhọidʌñ amọ, itooho ke idiọọkesịd a-amaakebaba. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Nte uwọdñkpọ, awo akeme isaña ye mbọhọidʌñ amọ edʌk akai edikikpịkke eto, ndin naña anye afʌñ ubọk adikpịkke eto ado ke ekịd, iwuod ekịt a-akeme ifakka awuọ aketọ mbọhọidʌñ amọ awot. Awo ado a-akeme adifeghe ñkaa abio keed ke atu ado adinyaaña uwem amọ. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Imiidooho ntoro asiousiene iyiib a-akeme adibịne anye ke ifiobesịd, abọhọ anye ke usʌñ akpenyọọñ abọhọ adikiwuọ abio udịbe, anyʌñ awot anye akpesʌkado anye idotto ñkpa, sia anye ikinieghe akaan idiọọkesịd ibaña mbọhọidʌñ amọ. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Ami ado ntak a-ami ibooho ndufo yak ediañña abio ita enịm enọ idem ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />Adieke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo anamma adaña ndufo atara, naña anye akenwọñọ anọ mme eteete ndufo, anyʌñ inọ ndufo afịd isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ ammọ, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />sia ndufo emenekke enịm mme mbed a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami adima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ñnyʌñ nsaña ke ñkobitem nnọọ anye, ndin ana ndufo emaana ediañña abio ita mfen enịm. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Inam ami mbaak iyiib awo i-imiidueghe adiduọkkọ ke isọñ ndufo, <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ nte udeemeñkpọ, ñko mbaak ndufo edidue ke uduọk iyiib.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Ado akpeto ke usua awo akedịbe, atịm anyʌñ awot mbọhọidʌñ, ndin anye afeghe akaa keed ke atu mme abio udịbe ado, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />mme ñkpisọñ ana edọñ ekoot awodawo ado, eben anye eto ke abio ado edi, enyʌñ eyaak anye enọ asiousiene iyiib nọ awot anye. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Ikiitua mbọm. Ana esio idiọọkñkpọ uduọkiyiib awo i-imiidueghe ke Isrel, nọ afọn ye ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />Ikiisịkke adaña mbọhọidʌñ ndufo e-emaekewuuk tọọñọ ke ayio esed ke udeemeñkpọ ndufo ebọọhọ ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo enie.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ntiense</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />Ntiense keed ikemme adidat mbiom awo ikpe ke idiọọkñkpọ akeedodo awo anamma. Ana ntiense iba me ita esọọñọ ikọ ndin ebiom awo ikpe.<verse eid="DEU 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Adieke ntiense nsu adaaha abo ke awo a-anam idiọọkñkpọ, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />mbon iba e-enieghe ikọ ado ana eda ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke iso mme aku ye mme abiideikpe e-ebaaha ke utom ke ini ado. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Mme abiideikpe ana enam nduuñọ ayọhọ-ayọhọ, ndin adieke ntiense ado adooho asʌhọ nsu, a-atieghe ntiense nsu abaña emọ-emọ awo Isrel, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />ana enam ye ntiense nsu ado kpa naña anye akeyem adinam ye awo anye ako. Ana esio idiọọkñkpọ ke atu ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Mbon mfen eyaekop enyʌñ efeghe ndịk, ndin utọ idiọọkñkpọ ado idiitịppeke aba ke atu ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Ikiitua mbọm: uwem akaa ke uwem, anyen akaa ke anyen, eded akaa ke eded, ubọk akaa ke ubọk, ukod akaa ke ukod.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Adika Ekọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Ke ini ndufo ekaaha ekọñ ye mme asua ndufo ndin e-ekịt mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd ye udịmekọñ a-akponno akan ake ndufo, ikiibaak ammọ, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, a-akisioho ndufo ke Iyib, ayaaba ye ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Ndufo emaebeeñe idem adika ekọñ, aku ayaawuọ ada atañ ikọ anọ udịmekọñ. <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />Anye ayaabo: “Ikop, Isrel: Mfịn ndufo ediika ekọñ ye mme asua ndufo. Ikiinie ayeemensia ikiinyʌñ ikop ndịk; ikiinie iduọesịd ikiinyʌñ ibaak ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ado andisaña ye ndufo anyʌñ anwana ye mme asua ndufo anyʌñ inọ edikan.”<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Mme etubom ekọñ eyaebo mme udịmekọñ: “Aba awo se ibọp ufa ufọk ndin idʌññọ diin? Yak anye anyọñ ufọk, sia anye akpekpa ke ekọñ awo mfen ayaakedʌñ do. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Aba awo se itọ inwañ fain ndin itọọñọke diin adikop inem amọ? Yak anye anyọñ ufọk, sia anye akpekpa ke ekọñ awo mfen ayaakekop inem. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Aba awo se inie edioomo ndọ ye awonwaan ado idọọhọ diin? Yak anye anyọñ ufọk, sia anye akpekpa ke ekọñ awo mfen ayaakeben adọ.” <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Ndin mme etubom ekọñ eyaedian, “Aba awo se ifeghe ndịk me anie ayeemensia? Yak anye atịmme anyọñ mbaak mme emọ-emọ mbon ekọñ edinyʌñ enie ayeemensia nte anye.” <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Ndin mme ñkpoon awo ekọñ emaetañ ikọ inọ mbon ekọñ ima, ammọ eyaemek mme adaiso se ise ñkpọ ibaña udịmekọñ.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Imaikaa adinwana ye abio, ito iyem emem ye ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Adieke ammọ enyịmmeke enyʌñ ebeere atob ammọ inọọ ndufo, afịd awo ke esịd abio ado ana edo mbon utom ndufo enyʌñ enam ñkpọ inọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Adieke ammọ esịnne edinam emem ado enwana ye ndufo, ikanna abio ado ikʌk. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaayaak abio ado asịn ke ubọk ndufo, iwot afịd ideen do ke akañkañ. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Amaado ibaan, ntəkayịn, ufene ye afịd ñkpọ mfen ke abio ado, emekeme edidat mbon ado nte ñkpọ mbịme enọ idem ndufo. Ñko emekeme edidat mbịme <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo abọọhọ mme asua ndufo inọọ. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Ntom ke ediinam ye afịd mme abio enyọọñọ usʌñ ekpọñ ndufo inyʌññọ ido abio mme idịd se ikpere ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Ado akpedo ke mme abio ke idịd <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo nte udeemeñkpọ, ikiiyak ñkpọ ndomokeed anweeghe inweek adu uwem. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Iwot afịd-afịd mbon Hed, mbon Amọọ, mbon Kenan, mbon Peris, mbon Hif ye mbon Yebus kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo akiwuuk ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Imiidooho ntoro, ammọ eyaikpeep ndufo edinañña afịd mme mbubiam ido a-ammọ enamma ke edu ukpono mme abasi ammọ, ndin ndufo eyaenam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Imaikanna abio ikʌk ke anyan ini, ke adinwana ndat anye, ikiikama ekịd ikpook mme eto iduọñọ, sia emekeme edidia mme mfịd amọ. Ikiikpook ammọ iduọñọ. Ado nte eto ado awo, nọ ndufo esịn ammọ ukad? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Ado ndufo emekeme edikpịkke mme eto a-ndufo ediọọñọke ke idooho eto mfịd enyʌñ edat ammọ ebọp akọ ubiọọñọ tutu abio a-ndufo enwanake ekọñ keed aduọ.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpeubọk ke abaña Uwodawo A-awo Imiikanna Idiọọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />Adieke ekịtte naña ewot awo ke ikọd ke isọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo edat enie, ado awo idiọọñọke andikiwod, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />mme ñkpisọñ ye mme abiideikpe ndufo eyaekaa ekedomo unyọọñ tọọñọ ke itie nte akpo awo ado ana tutu awuọ mme abio se ikanna akpo ado ikʌk. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Ndin mme ñkpisọñ e-edooho mme adaaha abio se ikpere akpo ado ikan eyaedat ñyịn umanenañ a-awo imiidatta inam utom akpa inyʌññọ ikọñọ akpọnọ akpa <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />ndin mme adaaha abio ado eyaedat anye ekaa abedeñ a-adooho akenam awo ifʌññọ inyʌññọ itọ, ake idịm a-afegheke anyʌññọ aba. Ke abedeñ ado yak mme adaaha ebuuñ itọñ ñyịn umanenañ ado. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Mme aku ubon Lifai eyaewuọ eda, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amek ammọ adinam ñkpọ ñnyʌñ nnọọ adidiọñ ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyʌñ mbiere afịd ikpe se ibaña eniin ye afai. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Ndin afịd mme ñkpisọñ ke abio a-akpereke akpo ado eyaeyie ubọk eduọk ñyịn umanenañ a-akebuuñọ itọñ ke abedeñ do, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />ndin ammọ eyaebo: “Ubọk ñnyịn ikiduọkkọ iyiib ami, anyen ñnyịn ikinyʌññọ ikịt idaha ekenamma. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Bọ uwa ami ke iwuod mbon mfo Isrel, a-afo afakka, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kuunyʌñ udat ke ñnyịn imidue ke uduọk iyiib awo i-imiidueghe.” Ndin eyaefeen uduọkiyiib ado, <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />ntom ke ndufo ediifak idem ndufo isio ke uduọk iyiib awo i-imiidueghe, sia emenam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidọ Awonwaan Mbuodekọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Imaikaa ekọñ ye mme asua ndufo ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaak ammọ isịn ndufo ke ubọk ndin ndufo enyʌñ edat mbuodekọñ, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />adieke afo akịtte uyaiya awonwaan a-afo amaaha, ke atu mbon e-emʌmmọ amekeme adidat anye nte anwaan mfo. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Dat anye dʌk ufọk mfo ndin nam anye akwaat ided iwuod amọ, akpok mbara amọ <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />ndin asịññe afọñidem a-anye akesịneke idaha ekemʌmmọ anye. Anye amaadʌñ ke ufọk mfo anyʌñ afʌhọ ete ye eka amọ ke afịd afiọñ keed, afo ndin amekeme adidọ anye ndin anye ado anwaan mfo. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Adieke afo umuunemme esịd ye anye, yak anye aka nte anye ama. Kuunyam anye, kuunyʌñ udat anye nte afʌn, sia afo amaasappa anye.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Unen Akpan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Adieke awodeen adọọhọ ibaan iba, ndin anye ama keed ado imaaha anye ako, ado naña iba eman nditọ ideen enọ anye, ado akpan amọ ado ayịn anwaan usua, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />anye amaadeeme ñkpọ anọ nditọ ideen amọ, inaaha anye aben unen akpan anọ ayịn anwaan ima ke itie akpan amọ, ayịn anwaan usua. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Ana anye adiọọñọ ayịn anwaan usua amọ nte akpan anyʌñ anọ anye udeeme ke itie iba ke atu afịd inie se anye anie. Akpan ado ado akpa idiọọñọ adudu ete amọ. Unen akpan anie anye.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asọñiwuod Ayịn Awodeen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />Adieke awo anieghe ayịn awodeen a-asọññọ iwuod anyʌñ asọñ aboditọñ, inyʌññọ ikop item inọ ete ye eka amọ, inyʌññọ ikpañ utọñ inọ ammọ ke ini emaetʌnọ anye, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />ete ye eka amọ eyaeben anye ekaa ke iso mme ñkpisọñ ke atob abio amọ. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Ammọ eyaebo mme ñkpisọñ abio, “Ayịn awodeen ñnyịn ami a-asọñ iwuod anyʌñ asọñ aboditọñ. Anye ikoppo item ñnyịn. Anye ado awo idiọọkitọñ anyʌñ ado awo inaam ukọd.” <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Ndin afịd ideen ke abio amọ ana etọọñ anye ke itiad ewot. Ana esio mbubiam unyọñ ke atu ndufo. Afịd Isrel eyaekop enyʌñ enie mbaak.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Nsio-nsio Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Adieke ewotto awo a-anamma akpan idiọọkñkpọ ndin ekọọñ akpo amọ ke eto, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />inaaha akpo ado akọñọ tutu ayio asiere. Ana ebuuk anye kpa usen ado, sia awo akeedodo e-ekọọñọ ke eto aba ke isuuñọ Abasi. Inaaha esappa isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ nte udeemeñkpọ.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Adieke akịtte naña abaakenañ me edọñ emọ-emọ awo Isrel atịn usʌñ, kuuboiyo ukpọñ, ado kịt bo ke imiben isọk andinie. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Akpedo ammọ idʌññọ ukpere fiin me udiọọñọke andinie, ben nyọñ ufọk mfo kenịm tutu andinie adiyem anye. Ndin yaak nọ andinie. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Nam ukem-ukem ado adieke afo akịtte dọñki me afọñ me ñkpọ ammọ ndomokeed mfen a-asoppo. Kuuboiyo ukpọñ.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Adieke afo akịtte naña dọñki me abaakenañ emọ-emọ awo Isrel aduọ ke usʌñ, kuusaña uboiyo. Nwam andinie nam nọ anye adakka ada.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Awonwaan inaaha asịne afọñ awodeen, awodeen ñko inaaha asịne afọñ awonwaan, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo a-asua awo se inam ntom.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Adieke afo akịtte efọk inuen ke mben usʌñ, me ke eto me ke isọñ, me naña eka inuen akʌbọ ke ñyịn me ke ñkwa, kuuben eka ye ñyịn. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Amekeme adiben ñyịn, ado kịt bo ke ameyaak eka nọ anyọñ, nọ afọn ye afo, afo anyʌñ anie anyan uwem.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Afo umaubọp ufa ufọk, bọp akọ kanna akọm mfo mbaak ududue isob uwodawo ke awo akpediañña ato akọm ado.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Ikiitọ utọ ñkpasi iba ke inwañ fain ndufo; adieke ndufo etọọhọ, ñkpọinwañ ye mfịd fain idiidooho adisana.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Ikiiyịt ayaaraenañ ye dọñki ikama ifʌñ isọñ inikeed.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Ikiisịne afọñ e-ewuaha idededọñ ye linen enam.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Inam ñyeriye ke naña inuuk inaañ afọñ se ndufo esịne.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubiad Mbed Ndọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />Adieke awodeen adọọhọ anwaan ndin ke anye amaakenie ewuana ye anye, adisua anye <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />anyʌñ adot anye ikọ ndin abiat anyịñ amọ, ate, “Ami mmaadọ awonwaan ami, ado ñkenie ewuana ye anye, ñkịtte uwọdñkpọ mboppo ke idem amọ,” <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />ndin ete ye eka ayịn abọikpa ado eyaeben uwọdñkpọ ke anye ado mboppo ediwọt mme ñkpisọñ abio. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Ete amọ ayaabo mme ñkpisọñ ate, “Ami ñkenọ ete ami ayịn awonwaan mmi ke ndọ, ado anye imaaha anye. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Idahami anye a-abiat anyịñ amọ anyʌñ abo, ‘Ayịn awonwaan mfo idooho mboppo.’ Ado se uwọdñkpọ mboppo ayịn mmi mi.” Ndin ete ye eka eyaewọt mme ñkpisọñ abio ado afọñ ado, <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />ndin mme ñkpisọñ abio ado eyaemia awodeen ado ufen. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Eyaedia anye isob udomo sekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.2</char></note> silfa ikie enọ ete ayịn awonwaan ado, sia ete ado anọ mboppo Isrel idiọọk anyịñ. Anye ayaakaa iso ado anwaan amọ; inaaha anye asio anye ndọ adaña nte anye aduuho uwem.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Adieke ikọ ami adooho akpanikọ ndin uwọdñkpọ mboppo ayịn awonwaan ibaaha, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />eyaeben anye ekaa anyenusʌñ ufọk ete amọ ndin ideen abio amọ eyaetọọñ anye ke itiad ewot. Anye a-anam abʌd-abʌd ñkpọ ke Isrel ke adisaña akpara ke ini anye asʌkkọ aba ke ufọk ete amọ. Ana esio mbubiam ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Adieke emʌmmọ awodeen naña anie ewuana ye anwaan awo mfen, ana awodeen ado ye awonwaan ado ekpa. Ana esio mbubiam ke atu Isrel.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Adieke awodeen akịtte mboppo e-emaekenyịmme ndọ ye awodeen mfen ke abio ndin anye akenie ewuana ye mboppo ado, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />ana ndufo eben naña ammọ iba eka inuaatob abio ado enyʌñ etọọñ ammọ ke itiad tutu ammọ ekpañña, abọikpa ado sia anye akeba ke abio inyʌññọ isio ñkpo iyem unwam, awodeen ado sia anye amaasappa anwaan awo mfen. Ana esio mbubiam ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Ado akpedo awodeen akekịt mboppo e-ekenyịmmeke ndọ ke inwañ ndin anye anaa anye ke ñkanubọk, awodeen ado kpọd ana akpa. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Ikiinam awonwaan ado ñkpọ ndomokeed; anye inamma idiọọkñkpọ ndomokeed inyʌññọ idot ñkpa. Ikpe anyem atie nte awo adiwot mbọhọidʌñ amọ, <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />sia awodeen ado akekịt ayịn awonwaan ado ke inwañ, ndin akpesʌkado awonwaan ado amaabọñ ñkpo, ikibaaha awo se inwam anye.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Adieke awodeen akịtte mboppo a-awo imiinyịmmeke ndọ ado anaa anye ke ñkanubọk ndin enyʌñ emʌm ammọ, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />awodeen ado ana akpe ete amọ udomo sekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ñkpọ nte kram 575</char></note> silfa aba mme duob. Ana anye adọ ayịn awonwaan ado, sia anye a-asappa anye. Inaaha awodeen ado asio awonwaan ado ndọ adaña nte awodeen ado aduuho uwem.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />Awodeen inaaha adọ anwaan ete amọ; inaaha anye asuenne ñkpana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru ufañ ami (Dit 22:30) ewet nte Dit 23:1.</char></note> ete amọ.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s1">Usio Awo ke Esob Nditọ Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">23: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru ekappa ewet Dit 23:1-25 nte Dit 23:2-26</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Awodeen e-emaekesio anye asio ke unuanuak me ke ukpekpịkke inaaha adʌk esob <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Me ayịn esiin a-amanake ato ndọ i-imiibọọhọ unyịmme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akemeido ñko ayịn akeminieghe ete</char></note> me awo a-atooho utọ ubon ado inaaha adʌk esob <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akpọkọm ado ayọhọ emana duob.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Awo Amọn me awo Mọb me ubon ammọ ndomokeed inaaha adʌk esob <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akpọkọm awuọ ayọhọ emana duob. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Sia ammọ ikiwuọhọ idi ye uyo ye mmọọñ idinọ ndufo idaha a-ndufo ekekpọññọ isọñ Iyib, ndin ammọ emaekpe Balaam ayịn Beo a-aketooho Petọ ke Aram Naharaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Adoro usobutịn Mesopotemia</char></note> ate isuuñọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ikikpañña utọñ inọ Balaam ado awọññọ isuuñọ ado akappa inọ ndufo nte adidiọñ, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ima ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Ikiidʌk edioomo ufan ye ammọ adaña nte ndufo eduuho uwem.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Ikiise awo Edọm ke mbio, sia ammọ edo imaan ndufo. Ikiinyʌñ isịn awo Iyib ke mbio, sia ndufo emaedʌñọ nte mme adidʌñ ke idịd ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Ayọhọ emana ita nditọ emanna enọ ammọ ekeme edidʌk esob <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbad ke Itie Nnaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Ndufo imaiba ke itie nnaaekọñ ibaña mme asua ndufo, isio idem ikpọñ ñkpọ se imiisanake. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Adieke keed ke atu ideen ndufo imiisanake ato ke se iwuọñọ anye ke idem ke akonayio, yak anye aba ke anwa. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Ado amaakpere ndubiayio ana anye ayie idem amọ, ndin ke usobutịn anye akeme adinyọñ ñkaa itie nnaaekọñ.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Isio itie inịm ke anwa nnaaekọñ nte itie ukeñidem. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Ana enie ñkpọ se ekama edọk isọñ ke atu ñkpọ se ekama, ndin emaekeñ idem ndufo, itịppe adudu ifʌk ikọd ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo asasaaña ke itie nnaaekọñ adikpeme ndufo ñnyʌñ ñyaak mme asua ndufo inọọ ndufo. Ana itie nnaaekọñ ndufo ado adisana, mbaak anye adikịt ke atu ndufo ndek-ndek ñkpọ ndin anye akpa edem iwọt ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Nsio-Nsio Mbed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Adieke afʌn adutʌmọke fiin, kuuyak anye unọọ eteufọk amọ. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Yak ammọ edʌñ ke atu ndufo ke itie nte ammọ emama ke abio a-ammọ emekke. Ikiifʌnnọ ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Awodeen me awonwaan Isrel ndomokeed inaaha ado akpara ñwommo. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Inaaha eben inie akpara awonwaan me ake akpara awodeen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru ekoot ake ewa</char></note> ndomokeed edʌk ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo edikama ñkpe akaaña, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo asua ammọ iba.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Ikiibọọ emọ-emọ awo Isrel udod, me ke akʌk me ke ndidia me ke ñkpọ mfen akeedodo e-ekemeke edibọ udod. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Emekeme edibọ asenawo udod, ado idooho emọ-emọ awo Isrel, nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo idiọñ ndufo ke afịd ñkpọ se ubọk ndufo atuuk ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaaha edidat nnie.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Adieke enamma akaaña enọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ikiikpeene edisio anye, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaibịp ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedue isob idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Ado adieke ndufo imiinamma akaaña, ndufo idiidueghe isob idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Se inua ndufo etañ ke eyaenam, ana ekịt ke emenam, sia ekenam akaaña ado ke imaesịd enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke inua ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Adieke ndufo edʌkkọ inwañ fain mbọhọidʌñ ndufo, emekeme edidia afịd mfịd kreb se ndufo eyem, ado ikiisịn ndomokeed ke ekpad ndufo iben idakka. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Adieke ndufo edʌkkọ inwañ abakpa mbọhọidʌñ ndufo, emekeme editañ ñkwa ke ubọk ndufo, ado inaaha ndufo ekama akọbọ ekpeeñe abakpa se idudak adudak.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />Adieke awodeen adọọhọ anwaan a-anye imiikoppo inem ibaña aba sia anye akịt ñkpọ se itek anye esịd, ndin anye awet ñwed uwuọndọ anọ anye, anyʌñ asio anye ke ufọk amọ, <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />ndin ke anye amaakekpọñ ufọk amọ anye adido anwaan awodeen mfen, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />ndin ayọhọ ebe iba ami asua anye anyʌñ awet ñwed uwuọndọ anọ anye anyʌñ asio anye ke ufọk amọ, ufa ebe ado akpekpa, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />akpa ebe, a-akesịnne anye, inaaha adimaana akedọ anye aba ke ini emaekesappa anye. Ado adiido mbubiam ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ.</char> Ikiiben idiọọkñkpọ isịn ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo nte udeemeñkpọ.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />Awodeen akpedọ anwaan ufa-ufa, inaaha enọ anye aka ekọñ me edọñ anye utom mfen. Ana esaana anye eyaak nọ anye atie ke ufọk ke isua keed anyʌñ anọ anwaan a-anye adọọhọ inemesịd.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Ikiidat itiad ukọkñkpọ iba, akpekọm andidoro ke anyọñ nte ubiọñ ke isọn, sia ado adiido adiben idịb udia awo nte ubiọñ.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Ekpekịt awo naña amʌm emọ-emọ awo Isrel asịn ke ukad me anyam anye nte afʌn, amʌm awo ado ana akpa. Ana esio mbubiam ke atu ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Idiọọk udọñọ ikpọkidem akpeba, inekke ikpeme adinam ukem-ukem se mme aku Lifai ebo enam. Ana enekke ekeene se ami ñwuuk ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Itoiyo se Abọọñ Abasi ndufo akenam ye Miriam ke usʌñ ke emaekewuọ ke Iyib.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Imainọ mbọhọidʌñ ndufo ewuọd akeedodo, ikiidʌk ufọk ammọ ikiben ñkpọ se ammọ inọọ ndufo nte ubiọñ. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Ida ke esiin nọ mbọhọidʌñ a-afo anọọhọ ewuọd do akeben ubiọñ ado usọk fiin. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Adieke mbọhọidʌñ mfo adooho uweene, ikiidaiya idab ye ubiọñ amọ ke ubọk mfo. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Ikpọñ afọñ amọ inọ anye mbemiso ayio akịm nọ anye anie se asịne adaiya. Ndin ammọ eyaukọọm fiin, ndin eyaebat nte eti ido ke iso Abọọñ Abasi ndufo<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Ikiitʌk awo utom a-adooho uweene anyʌñ ado awo unana, me ado emọ-emọ awo Isrel me asenawo a-adʌññọ ke abio ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Ikpe ammọ akʌk usen mbemiso utịn asop, sia ammọ edo uweene enyʌñ edot anyen ke ado. Imiidooho ammọ ekeme ediseeme nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibaña ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedue isob idiọọkñkpọ.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Inaaha ewot mme ete ye mme eka ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ nditọ ammọ, awo inyʌññọ iwot nditọ ke ntak idiọọkñkpọ mme ete ye eka ammọ; ana anam idiọọkñkpọ akpa ke idiọọkñkpọ amọ.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />Ikiikpe ukwañ ikpe inọọ asenawo me nditọakpa, ikiinyʌñ iben afọñ ebekpa nte ubiọñ. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Itoiyo ke ndufo emaedo ifʌn ke Iyib ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amaifak ndufo asio do. Ntak ado anam iwuuk ndufo nọ enam ntom.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Ndufo imaidọk idọk ke inwañ ndufo ndin ebọhọ eto eboho abakpa keed, ikiitịmme ikikpeeñe. Ikpọñ inọ mme adidʌñ, nditọakpa ye ebekpa, nọ Abọọñ Abasi ndufo idiọñ ndufo ke afịd se ubọk ndufo anam. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Imaiyuup eto ọlif, ikiimaana iyuup ñkọk ayọhọ akañ iba. Ikpọñ se isʌhọ inọ mme adidʌñ, nditọakpa ye mme ebekpa. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Imaikịppe mme kreb ke inwañ fain ndufo, ikiitịmme ikaa ayọhọ akañ iba. Ikpọñ se isʌhọ inọ mme adidʌñ, nditọakpa ye ebekpa. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Itoiyo ke ndufo emaedo ifʌn ke Iyib. Ntak ado anam ami mbo yak ndufo enam ntom.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Mme awo emaenie utọk, ana ammọ eben eka esob, ndin mme abiideikpe eyaebiide ikpe, esaana anana ndudue eyaak enyʌñ esua enọ anam ndudue. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Andidue akpedot se emamia, abiideikpe ayaanam ammọ enyanna enaa enyʌñ emia ammọ ubọkikpa se idot ye ndudue amọ, <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />ado akpeikpe inaaha abiide akan ubọkikpa aba. Adieke emiaha anam ndudue ekan ado, adiido emiom anọ emọ-emọ awo Isrel ke iso ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Ikiibọp abaakenañ inua ke ini anye anamma utom ufiakka ukwak ukọk ñkpọ.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />Adieke nditọeka ideen edʌññọ keed ndin keed akpa inieghe ayịn, anwaan a-anye akpaaha akpọñ inaaha adọ awo ke ekpək mfen. Ayịneka ebe amọ ayaadat anye adọ anyʌñ anam ubiọñutom ayịneka ebe anọ anye. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Akpa ayịn a-anye amanna adiikere anyịñ anọ ayịneka andikikpa ado mbaak anyịñ amọ adisop ke Isrel.<verse eid="DEU 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Akpedo ayịneka ebe amọ iyemme adidọ anwaan ayịneka amọ, anwaan ado ayaakaa abịne mme ñkpisọñ ke atob abio ate, “Ayịneka ebe mmi a-asịn adinam ubon ayịneka amọ asakka ke Isrel. Anye inyịmmeke adinam ubiọñutom ayịneka ebe innọọ miin.” <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Ndin mme ñkpisọñ abio amọ eyaekoot anye etañ ikọ ye anye. Anye akpesʌk ayịre abo, “Ami ñyemme adidọ anye,” <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />anwaan ayịneka amọ ayaakaa abịne anye ke iso mme ñkpisọñ, asio ukod ikpaukod amọ keed, afiat anye etab ke iso ndin abo ate, “Se ediinam awodeen i-imiiyemme adibọp ubon ayịneka amọ ado ami.” <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Eyaediọọñọ ubon ete ado ke Isrel nte Ubon Esioho Ikpaukod.<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Adieke ideen iba enwanake anwan ndin anwaan keed ke atu ado adi adinyaaña ebe amọ asio ke ubọk andinwana ye anye, ndin anwaan ado asịn ubọk amʌm awodeen ado idem ideen, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />ana ndufo ekpịkke awonwaan ado ubọk esio. Ikiitua anye mbọm.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />Ikiinie nsio-nsio udomoñkpọ iba ke ekpad ndufo, keed ndodoppo, keed ñyayakka. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Ikiinie nsio-nsio udomoñkpọ iba ke ufọk ndufo, keed ekamba, keed etək. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Ana ndufo enie udomoñkpọ a-afọnnọ, anen anyʌñ ado nnekke-nnekke, nọ ndufo edu anyan uwem ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo asua awo akeedodo a-anamma mme ñkpọ ami, awo a-anamma ñwo.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />Itoiyo se mbon Amalek ekinam ndufo idaha ndufo eketooho Iyib edi. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Idaha idem akimemme ndufo enyʌñ ekpa mba, ammọ emaedisịme ndufo ke usʌñ isañ enyʌñ ewoot mbon ekekpọttọ ke edem; ammọ ikinieghe mbaak Abasi. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo amainọ ndufo nduọkadudu ito afịd mme asua ndufo e-ekannake ndufo ekʌk ke isọñ a-anye inọọhọ ndufo edat enie nte udeemeñkpọ, eyaesọọk anyịñ Amalek esio ke idak anyọñ. Ikiifre!<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Akpa Mfịd ye Mbakka Keed ke Itie Duob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Ndufo imaidʌk isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo nte udeemeñkpọ inyʌñ iben inie inyʌñ idʌk idʌñ ke esịd, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />idat mme akpa mfịd afịd ñkpọ inwañ ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo inyʌñ idọñ ke akpan. Ndin ikaa itie <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adiimek nte itie idʌñ inọ Anyịñ amọ <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />ndin idọkkọ aku a-abaaha ke utom ini ado, “Ami mmebo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo mfịn ami ke mmedi ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke anọ mme eteete ñnyịn adinọọ ñnyịn.” <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Aku ayaibọ ndufo akpan ayaak anịm ke iso akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Ndin ndufo eyaebo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo: “Ete mmi akedo ñyooñ awo Aram, ndin anye amaakaa Iyib ye akpọ awo ifañ anyʌñ adʌñ do akappa ekamba idịd, akop uko anyʌñ awak. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Ado mbon Iyib emaifʌnnọ ñnyịn enyʌñ enam ñnyịn ibọ ufen ke akpọsọñ utom. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Ndin ñnyịn imaitua iseeme inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ñnyịn, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop uyio ñnyịn anyʌñ akịt ukuud, ufen ye ufiik ñnyịn. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaisio ñnyịn ke Iyib ke akpọsọñ ubọk ye ñnyanna ubọk, ye ekamba ndịk ye mme idiọọñọ ye mme utịppeñkpọ. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Anye akiben ñnyịn adi isọñ ami, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk; <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />ndin idahami ami mmeben akpa mfịd a-atooho isọñ a-afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> annọọhọ miin.” Nịm akpan ado ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo nyʌñ tuak iwuod nọ anye. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Ndin afo ye mme Lifai ye mme adidʌñ e-edʌññọ ke atu ndufo eyaedaara ke afịd nti ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo unọọ fiin ye ufọk mfo.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Ke ini ndufo emaesio mbaak keed ke itie duob afịd mbunwịm ndufo ke ayọhọ isua ita, isua mbaak keed ke itie duob, ndufo eyaenọ mme Lifai, mme adidʌñ, mme nditọakpa ye mme ebekpa, nọ ammọ enie se edia ke mme abio ndufo enyʌñ ekop uyʌkkọ. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Ndin bo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo: “Ami mmesio adisana udeeme ke ufọk mmi ndin mmenọ mme Lifai, mme adidʌñ, mme nditọakpa ye mme ebekpa, akeene afịd se afo aketemme. Ami ñwọññọke ñkpọñ mme ewʌhọ mfo ñnyʌññọ mfre ammọ ndomokeed. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Ami ñkidiaha adisana ndidia ndomokeed idahami ñkebaaha ke mfʌhọ, ñkinyʌññọ nsio ndomokeed idaha a-ami mmiikisanake, me adiben ndomokeed nnọọ akpañkpa. Ami mmekop item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi; ami mmenam afịd ñkpọ se afo akebo yak nnam. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Tie ke hefịn, adisana itie idʌñ mfo, suuk anyen se, nyʌñ diọñ mbon mfo Isrel ye isọñ a-afo inọọhọ ñnyịn kpa naña akenwọñọ anọọ mme eteete ñnyịn, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk.”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Keene Mme Item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo iwuuk ndufo mfịn ami ate, ikeene mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed ami; inekke ikpeme ammọ ke afịd esịd ndufo ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Ndufo emebo ke usen mfịn ami ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi ndufo ndin ke ndufo eyaesaña ke ñkobitem enọ anye, ke ndufo eyaenịm mme ewʌhọ, mme item ye mme mbed amọ, ke eyaekpañ utọñ enọ anye. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ anwa-anwa mfịn ami ke ndufo edo mbon amọ, ñkpọuto inie amọ kpa naña anye akenwọñọ, ndin yak ndufo enịm mme item amọ. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Anye a-abo ke imọ iyainọ ndufo itooro, uwuọetob ye ukpono akponno akan afịd mme idịd se anye akebot ndin ke ndufo ediido mme ndisana ibon inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, kpa naña anye akenwọñọ.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Itie Ukpono ke Abod Ebal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Moses ye mme ñkpisọñ Isrel emaewuuk afịd awo ete: “Inịm afịd mme item se ami inọọ ndufo mfịn ami. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Imaikaaña Yọdan idʌk isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo, ibono mme ñkpoon itiad inyʌñ ikama ndom ideppe ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Iwet afịd mme ikọ mbed ami ke ndufo emaekaaña ekedʌk isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo, isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ndufo, akenwọñọ inọọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Ndin ndufo imaikaaña Yọdan, ibono mme itiad ami ke Abod Ebal, kpa naña ami iwuuk ndufo mfịn ami, inyʌñ ikama ndom ideppe ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Ibọp akpokoro uwa ke ndo inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, itieukpono enamma ke itiad. Ikiikama ñkpọ utom ukwak idat inam ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Ibọp itieukpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke itiad a-awo imiikpịkkekekpịkke inyʌñ iwa ufọfọb uwa ke ndo inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Iwa uwa ewuana ke ndo, idia inyʌñ idaara ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Ndin ndufo eyaewet nọ enekke emọọnọ afịd ikọ se isịne ke mbed ke mme itiad ami.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Isuuñọ E-etooho Abod Ebal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Ndin Moses ye mme aku Lifai emaebo afịd Isrel, “Isrel, idop uyio, inyʌñ ikpañ utọñ! Idahami ndufo edido mbon <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Ikop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inyʌñ ikeene mme item ye mme ewʌhọ amọ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Kpa ke usen ado Moses amaawuuk mme atu awo:<verse eid="DEU 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />Ndufo imaikaaña Yọdan, mme ubon ami eyaeda ke Abod Kerisịm adidiọñ mbonawo: Simiọn, Lifai, Yuda, Isaka, Yosef ye Benyamin. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Ndin mme ubon ami eyaeda ke Abod Ebal enọ isuuñọ: Rubịn, Kad, Asaa, Sebulọn, Daan ye Naftali.<verse eid="DEU 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Mme Lifai eyaetañ ke akpọsọñ uyio enọ afịd awo ke Isrel:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-anamma ubobodñkpọ, a-adooho mbubiam ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, utom ubọk anamusọ ndin aben anịm ke ndedịbe itie.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:15">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-asuenneke ete ye eka amọ.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:16">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-asịkkeke itiad adaña mbọhọidʌñ amọ.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:17">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-atịnne nnan usʌñ.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:18">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-amʌmmọ unen asenawo, me ake nditọakpa me ake ebekpa akama.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:19">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-anieghe ewuana ye anwaan ete amọ, sia anye a-asappa akwañ ete amọ.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:20">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen”<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-anieghe ewuana ye unam.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:21">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen”<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-anieghe ewuana ye ayịneka amọ awonwaan, me ayịnete amọ awonwaan me ayịn awonwaan e-eka amọ amanna.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:22">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-anieghe ewuana ye eka anwaan amọ.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:23">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-awotto mbọhọidʌñ amọ ke ndedịbe.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:24">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo a-abọọhọ ubọk edem adiwot awo i-imiidueghe.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:25">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“Adọdiọọk anọ awo i-imiinịmme mme ikọ mbed ami ke edinam ammọ.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:26">Ndin afịd awo eyaebọọrọ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Adidiọñ Etooho Ñkobitem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Adieke ndufo ekoppo item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ enekke ekeene afịd mme item ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaidịppe ndufo ekoñ ekan afịd mme idịd ke ederimbod. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Afịd mme adidiọñ ami ayainie ndufo anyʌñ ikeene ndufo adieke ekoppo item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo:<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Eyaidiọñ ndufo ke abio ye ke inwañ.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Eyaediọñ mfịd idịb ndufo, ye mbunwịm inwañ ndufo ye ñyịn ufene ndufo, mme ñyịn enañ ye mme ñyịn edọñ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Eyaediọñ akpan ndufo ye ñkpọ unuak ndomuyo ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Eyaidiọñ ndufo ke edʌkkọdʌk edi ye ke ewuọhọwuọ.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ndufo ekan mme asua ndufo e-ediighe ikọ ye ndufo. Ammọ eyaeto usʌñ keed edi ado eyaefeeñe ke usʌñ itiaba.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaadọñ adidiọñ anọ mme itie ubonoñkpọ ndufo ye ke afịd ñkpọ se ubọk ndufo atuuk. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaidiọñ ndufo ke isọñ a-anye inọọhọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayainịm ndufo nte mme ndisana mbon amọ, kpa naña anye akenwọñọ ke unwọñọ, adieke ndufo enịmme item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ esaña ke ñkobitem amọ. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Ndin afịd awo ke ekondo eyaekịt ke ikoot ndufo ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin ammọ eyaibaak ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaidiọñ ndufo ye uwak uforo ke mfịd idịb ndufo, ke mme ñyịn ufene ndufo ye mme mbunwịm inwañ ke isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke anọ mme eteete ndufo edinọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaabeere mme hefịn, itie ubono nti ñkpọ amọ, anọ edịm ke isọñ ndufo ke akem ini anyʌñ adiọñ afịd ubọkutom ndufo. Ndufo ediwọwuọt uwak mme idịd ado ndufo idiiwuọtọ ito amọ ndomokeed. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayainam ndufo edo iwuod, idooho isịm. Adieke ndufo ekpañña utọñ ekop item se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami enyʌñ ekpeme edinam ammọ, afịd ini ndufo ediiba ke anyọñ, ibaaha ke idak. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Ikiiwọññọ ikpọñ item a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami, me ke nnasia me ke ufiin, ikeene mme abasi mfen inyʌñ inam ñkpọ inọ ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isuuñọ A-anieghe Ntịdutọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Akpedo anam, ndufo ikoppo item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inyʌññọ inekke inam afịd mme item amọ ye mme ewʌhọ ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami, afịd mme isuuñọ ami ayaikeene ndufo anyʌñ ifʌk ndufo:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Eyaisuuñọ ndufo ke abio ye ke inwañ.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Eyaisuuñọ akpan ye ñkpọ unuak ndomuyo ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Eyaisuuñọ mfịd idịb ndufo, mbunwịm inwañ ndufo, ye mme ñyịn enañ ke atu udịmenañ ndufo ye ñyịn edọñ ke atu udịmedọñ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Eyaisuuñọ ndufo ke emaedʌk edi ye ke emaewuọñọ.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaadọñ mme isuuñọ, ndukpakka ye ndʌdutọñ ke afịd ñkpọ se ubọk ndufo atuuk adinam, tutu isobo ndufo ndin edʌk atahade ato ke ndiọiñkpọ a-ndufo enaññake ke adifeghe ñkpọñ anye.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido miin</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaifọppọ ndufo ye mme udọñọ tutu anye isobo ndufo ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaaha edidʌk ndat nnie. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaitʌnọ ndufo ye udọñọ ñyeeme, ufiobidem ye ñkunya, ye akpọsọñ ufiob ye unanaedịm, ye mfuud ye ntọdibọ, ediifʌnnọ ndufo tutu ndufo esobo. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Ikpaanyọñ a-afʌkkọ iwuod ndufo adiido brọns ndin idakisọñ ado ukwak. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam edịm abio ndufo akappa ado abu ye ntọñ; adiito anyọñ idep tutu isobo ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam mme asua ndufo ikan ndufo ke ekọñ. Ndufo eyaebịne ammọ ke usʌñ keed ado ndufo eyaefeeñe ke usʌñ itiaba, ndin ndufo ediido ñkpọ ndọk inọ afịd mme idịd ke ekondo. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Mme akpo ndufo ediido ndidia inọ afịd mme inuen ye mme ndiọi unam, ndin idiibaaha awo se ibịne ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ndufo enie mme ndufuud mbon Iyib ye ayo, inia ye mfad, a-adooho idiikanna ikọk. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaitọ ndufo idaad, nnan ye ndutịme akikere. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Ke ufọọd uweemeayio iba ndufo eyaeweweere ubọk nte nnan ke ekịm. Idiikịtte unen ke afịd ñkpọ se ndufo enam; ke usen ke usen eyaifiik ndufo enyʌñ eyịp ñkpọ ndufo, idiibaaha awo ndomokeed se idiinyaaña ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Ayaabeeñe idem adidọ awonwaan, ado awodeen mfen ayaadiben anye anaa ke ñkanubọk. Ayaabọp ufọk, ado uduudʌññọ ke esịd. Ayaatọ inwañ fain, ado uduukoppo inem mfịd amọ. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Eyaewot ayaaraenañ mfo ke iso mfo, ado uduutaaha ndomokeed. Eyaeben dọñki mfo ke ñkanubọk inyʌññọ iben itịmme idi. Eyaeben edọñ mfo enọ mme asua mfo, ndin ibaaha ake adiikifak ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Eyaeben nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfo enọ idịd mfen, afo ayaase usʌñ ke usen ke usen abet idaha ediitịmme idi, inieghe se akan anam. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Mbon awo se ndufo imiidiọọñọke ediidia ufọn ñkpọ se ubọk ndufo ekenam, ndin idiikịtte ñkpọ ikan idiọọk ufiik ke afịd ayio uwem ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Se anyen ndufo ekịt eyaenam ndufo edamma. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ubiak ndufuud a-awo imiidikanna ikọk inam ndufo ke edọñ ye ke ukod, atara tọọñọ ke idak ikpad ndufo tutu awuọ anyọñ iwuod ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaibịne ndufo ye adidem ndufo ekaa idịd a-ndufo me mme eteete ndufo imiikidiọọñọke. Ke udo ndufo eyaekpono mme abasi mfen, mme abasi eto ye itiad. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Ndufo ediido ñkpọ ndọk, ñkpọ ufiid ye ñkpọ nsaha ke atu afịd mme awo se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiibịne ndufo nọ eka.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Ndufo eyaetọ uwak ñkpasi ke inwañ ado edọk etək-etək, sia ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ ayaata anye. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Eyaetọ mme inwañ fain enyʌñ ediọñ ammọ ado ndufo idiinwọññọ ukọd amọ idiinyʌññọ itañ mme mfịd fain, sia mme utʌñ ediita ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Eyaenie eto ọlif ke afịd idịd ndufo ado ndufo idiikamake adan amọ inam ñkpọ, sia mfịd ọlif ado ayaabeghe. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Ndufo eyaenie nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan ado ndufo idiikịtte ammọ sia eyaetañ ammọ esio. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Mme ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ eyaedat afịd mme eto ye mbunwịm ke isọñ ndufo enie.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Mme adidʌñ e-edʌñọke ke atu ndufo eyaekoñ ikan ndufo, ado ndufo eyaekaaka iso esọiyọ edʌk idak. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Ammọ ediiwuọt ndufo ñkpọ, ado ndufo idiinọọhọ ammọ ewuọd. Ammọ ediido iwuod, ado ndufo ediido isịm.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Afịd mme isuuñọ ami eyaidoro ndufo ke idem. Eyaibịne ndufo enyʌñ ifuuk ndufo tutu esobo ndufo, sia ndufo ikikoppo item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inyʌññọ inam mme item ye mme ewʌhọ a-anye akinọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Ammọ ediido mme idiọọñọ ye mme utịppeñkpọ enọ mme ubon ndufo ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Sia ndufo ikinamma ñkpọ inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke idaara ye ke inemesịd ke ini ñkpọmfọn, <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />ke ntoro ke abiọọñ ye nsaditọñ, ke ifed ye akpọikpọi uweene, ndufo eyaenam ñkpọ enọ mme asua <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> anọọhọ ibịne ndufo. Anye ayaikọọñ ndufo akpọnọ ukwak ke itọñ tutu anye isobo ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaaben idịd a-atooho anyan usʌñ ibịne ndufo, ato ke utịd ederimbod, nte ntrukpuum a-afuurọke asọiyọ isọñ, idịd a-adooho usem ammọ ndufo idiikoppo, <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />aniendịk idịd imiinieghe ukpono inọ usọñ inyʌññọ inie mbọm inọ ntəkayịn. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Ammọ eyaeta ufene ndufo enyʌñ edia mbunwịm inwañ ndufo tutu esobo isọñ ndufo. Ammọ idiisʌhọke abakpa ndomokeed, ufa ukọd me adan ọlif, me ñyịn enañ ke atu udịmenañ ndufo me ñyịn edọñ ke atu udịmedọñ ndufo tutu ndufo etahade. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Ammọ eyaekanna afịd abio ke afịd isọñ ndufo ekʌk tutu mme ñnyan ndibene a-ndufo enieghe idodanyen eduọ. Ammọ eyaekanna afịd mme abio ke isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Ke ntak ukuud se ndufo ediibọ ke ubọk mme asua ndufo ke ini ammọ ikannake ndufo ekʌk, ndufo eyaedia mfịd idịb ndufo, abʌk nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo inọọhọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Awo ataa esịd mbọm ye andisuuhọ idem ñkan ke atu ndufo idiikoppo mbọm ibaña ayịneka amọ awodeen me anwaan a-anye amaaha me nditọ amọ se isʌhọ, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />anye idiinyʌññọ inọ awo ammọ ndomokeed abʌk nditọ amọ a-anye ataaha. Ukweeñe se idiisʌhọ inọ anye adodo ato ke ukuud se asua ndufo adiisịn ndufo ke ini ekannake afịd mme abio ndufo ekʌk. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Ataa asuukidem ye anie esịd mbọm awonwaan ke atu ndufo, a-asuuhọke idem anyʌñ akop mbọm tutu esịdikpad amọ ikpituuhọ isọñ, idiinieghe mbọm inọ ebe a-anye amaaha ye ayịn amọ awodeen me ayịn awonwaan, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />abid awuọhọ anye ke idịb ye nditọ a-anye amanna. Sia ke akpọsọñ unana anye a-aduak adidedịbe nta ammọ ato ke ukuud se asua ndufo adiisịn ndufo ke ini ekannake mme abio ndufo ekʌk.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Adieke ndufo imiinekkeke inịm afịd mme ikọ mbed ami, e-ewette ke ñwed ami, inyʌññọ iteeñe ubọọñ ye uyaiya anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaadọñ mme aniendịk udọñọ inọ ndufo ye mme ubon ndufo, ñkpọsọñ ye ukuud a-akpeeneke, ñkpọsọñ ye mme udọñọ a-akpeeneke. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Anye ayainọ ndufo afịd mme udọñọ ke Iyib a-ndufo ekefegheke, ndin ammọ eyaidiana ndufo ke idem. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayainọ ndufo afịd utọ udọñọ ye nnananyen se awo imiiwette ke Ñwed Mbed ami, tutu isobo ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Ndufo e-ekewakka nte ntantaafiọñ ediikappa ido ibad-ibad awo, sia ndufo ikikoppo item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Kpa naña akenem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adinam ndufo eforo enyʌñ ewak ke ibad, kpa ntoro ke adiinem anye aditahade ñnyʌñ nsobo ndufo. Eyaewịppe ndufo esio ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaaha edidat nnie.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaisuan ndufo ke atu mme idịd, tọọñọ ke utịd ederimbod keed tutu utịd uko. Ke udo ndufo eyaekekpono mme abasi mfen, mme abasi eto ye itiad, a-adooho ndufo ye mme eteete ndufo idiọọñọke. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Ke atu mme idịd ado ndufo idiibọọhọ emem, itie nduọkadudu idiibaaha inọ ñkpad ndufo. Ke udo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ndufo eba ke ayeemensia, anyen ndufo eyaekpa mba ye udọñ ye iduọesịd. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Ndufo ediiyịre akpəho, eyọhọ ye ndịk akonayio ye uweemeayio, idiọọñọke me eyaedu uwem me idiiduuho. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Ubakusen ndufo eyaebo, “Akpekapado ndubiayio!” ndin ke ndubiayio ndufo eyaebo, “Akpekapado ubakusen!” ato ke ndịk se idiiyọhọ esịd ndufo ye mme ñkpọ se anyen ndufo ediikịt. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaidọñ ndufo ke mme ubom, ndufo eyaetịmme ekaa Iyib ke isañ a-ami ñkebooho ke ndufo idiikaaha aba. Imaikiwuọ udo ndufo eyaenyam idem ndufo nte ifʌn ibaan ye ifʌn ideen enọ mme asua ndufo, ado ibaaha awo adiidep ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s1">Adidemme Edioomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">29: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru Dit 29:1 ekappa ewet nte Dit 28:69, ndin Dit 29:2-29 ewet Dit 29:1-28.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Ami edoñño mme ikọ edioomo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akebooho Moses anam ye mbon Isrel ke Mọb, adian ye edioomo a-anye akenamma ye ammọ ke Họreb.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Moses amaakoot afịd nditọ Isrel ndin abo ammọ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 29:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 29:2">Anyen ndufo ekịt afịd se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam Fero ke Iyib, anam awuọ afịd mme adaaha amọ ye afịd isọñ amọ. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Ke anyen ndufo emaekịt mme ñkpoon mbaba, mme idiọọñọ ye mme ñkpoon utịppeñkpọ. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Ado tutu awuọ usen mfịn ami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inọọhọ ndufo esịd a-anieghe ifiọk me anyen a-akịtte usʌñ me utọñ a-akoppo ñkpọ. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Kpayeado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo, “Ke mme isua aba a-ami ñkidatta ndufo nsaña mboiyo ke anaan, afọñ ndufo ikiwaiyake, ikpaukod ndufo ikinyʌññọ itaha ke ukod ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Ndufo ikitaaha uyo ndomokeed ikinyʌññọ inwọñ ukọd ndomokeed me ndañ ukọd mfen. Ami ñkenam ami nọ ndufo ediọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo.”<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Ndufo ekediwuọ itie ami, Sihọn adidem Hesbọn ye Ọk adidem Basan emaewuọñọ edi edinwana ye ñnyịn, ado ñnyịn imaikan ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Ñnyịn imaidat isọñ ammọ iben inọ ubon Rubịn, ubon Kad ye ubaak esiin Manase nte udeemeñkpọ.<verse eid="DEU 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Inekke ikeene mme ikọ edioomo ami, nọ ndufo eforo ke afịd ñkpọ se ndufo enam. <verse eid="DEU 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Mfịn ami afịd ndufo eda ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, mme ñkpisọñ ye mbọọñ, mme adaaha ye ñkpoon awo, ye afịd mbon mfen ke Isrel, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />ye nditọ ndufo ye ibaan ndufo, ye mme adidʌñ e-edʌññọ ke mme itie nnaa esiak ifia enyʌñ ebọ mmọọñ inọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Ndufo eda ke mmi edidʌk edioomo ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, edioomo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> anamma ye ndufo mfịn ami anyʌñ asọọñọ ye unwọñọ, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />edisọọñọ ke usen mfịn ke ndufo edo mbon amọ, ndin ke anye ado Abasi ndufo naña anye akenwọñọ anọ mme ete ndufo, Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Ami nnam edioomo ami, ke unwọñọ, idooho ye ndufo kpọd <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />e-edaaha mi ye ñnyịn mfịn ami ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, ado kpa ye mbon i-imiibaaha mi mfịn ami.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Ndufo ke idem ndufo emediọọñọ naña ñnyịn ikidʌñ ke Iyib ndin naña ikisaña iboiyo mme idịd ndin idisịm itie ami. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Ndufo emaekịt ke atu mme idịd ado mme mbubiam ubobodñkpọ ye mme usọsọi ñkpọ e-enamma ke eto ye itiad, ye ke silfa ye kold. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Ikịt ibo ke ibaaha awodeen me awonwaan, ubon me esiin ke atu ndufo mfịn ami e-esịd amọ awọññọke akpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi aka akekpono mme abasi mme idịd ado; ikịt ibo ke ibaaha adʌñ ndomokeed ke atu ndufo a-asioho utọ idod-idod ibọkñkpa ado.<verse eid="DEU 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Utọ awo ado amaakop mme ikọ unwọñọ ami anyʌñ atañña adidiọñ anọ idem ammọ, akere, “Ñyaabọkkọ akpesʌkado nsañake naña mma,” ammọ eyaeben afanekọñ esọk ndedeñ isọñ ye nsaad. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiinyịmmeke adifeen nnọọ ammọ; iyadesịd ye akpọsọñ ufịb amọ ayaafọp ammọ. Afịd isuuñọ e-ewette ke ñwed ami ayaasịm ammọ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasọọk anyịñ ammọ asio ke idak ikpaanyọñ. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasat ammọ asio ke atu mme esiin Isrel nọ ammọ ekịt nsobo, kpa naña mme isuuñọ edioomo e-ewette ke Ñwed Mbed ami abo.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Nditọ ndufo se idiikeene ndufo ke mme emana a-adiighe ke iso ye mme adidʌñ e-etooho mme anyan idịd edi eyaekịt mme ukuud e-ekesịmme isọñ ado ye mme udọñọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akekama afọppọ anye. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Afịd isọñ adiido ntaikañ inʌñ ye sọlfọ, awo itọọhọ ñkpọ ndomokeed, ñkpọ ndomokeed itịppeke, ñkọñ ndomokeed ibaaha ke esịd. Adiitie nte nsobo Sọdọm ye Komora, Adma ye Seboyịm, <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akesuanna ke ataa ifiobesịd. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Afịd mme idịd eyaebịp: “Nsoo ido nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam ntom ke isọñ ami? Nsoo ido utọ ufiob-ufiob iyadesịd ami?”<verse eid="DEU 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Ndin ibọọrọ adiido: “Ntak ado ke ibon ami emaewọññọ ekpọñ edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi mme eteete ammọ, edioomo a-anye akenamma ye ammọ idaha anye akesioho ammọ ke Iyib. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Ammọ emaedaaña ekekpono mme abasi mfen enyʌñ etuak iwuod enọ ammọ, mme abasi a-ammọ imiikidiọọñọke, mme abasi a-anye imiikinọọhọ ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Ke ntak ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd eti-eti ye isọñ ami, ado anam anye amaaben afịd isuuñọ se ewet ke ñwed ami adot isọñ ado. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Ke akpọsọñ iyadesịd ye ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawịppe ammọ asio ke isọñ ammọ ndin atop ammọ asịn ke isọñ mfen, naña aba idahami.”<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Mme ndedịbe ñkpọ enie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn, ado mme ñkpọ se eyaara inie ñnyịn ye nditọ ñnyịn ke nsi-nsi, nọ ñnyịn inam afịd ikọ se isịne ke mbed ami.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">Uforo ke Emaetịmme Enyọñ Ekeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Ke ini afịd mme adidiọñ ye mme isuuñọ a-ami nnịmme ke iso ndufo amaisịm ndufo ndin ndufo enyʌñ eben ammọ esịn ke esịd ndufo itie akeedodo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo isuanna ndufo ke atu mme idịd, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />ndin ndufo ye nditọ ndufo emaetịmme ebịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ ekop item amọ ke afịd esịd ndufo ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo, ekeene afịd ñkpọ se itemme ndufo mfịn ami, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaamaana inọ ndufo se ikitak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme inyʌñ ndo aben ndufo asio ke ufʌn</char></note> anyʌñ itua ndufo mbọm, amaana ikoono ndufo ato afịd mme idịd a-anye akisuanna ndufo adọñ. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Akpekọm ekibịn ndufo ekaa ataa anyan isọñ ke idak mme hefịn, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaikoono ndufo ato udo anyọñ adi. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaiben ndufo adi isọñ a-akenieghe mme eteete ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedat anye enie. Anye ayaanam ndufo eforo e-enyʌñ ewak ekan mme eteete ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaanam esịd ndufo asana ye esịd ubon ndufo, nọ ndufo ema anye ke afịd esịd ndufo ye afịd ukpọñ ndufo, enyʌñ edu uwem. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaadot afịd mme isuuñọ ado ke idem mme asua isuaha ndufo enyʌñ ifʌnnọ ndufo. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Ndufo eyaemaana ekop item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ enam afịd mme item amọ a-ami inọọhọ ndufo mfịn ami. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaanam ndufo eforo ekan ke afịd ubọkutom ndufo ye mfịd idịb ndufo, ñyịn ufene ndufo ye mbunwịm inwañ ndufo. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaamaana anem esịd ye ndufo anyʌñ anam ndufo eforo, kpa naña anye akenem esịd ye mme eteete ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />adieke ndufo ekoppo item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ enịm mme item ye mme ewʌhọ amọ e-ekewette ke Ñwed Mbed ami enyʌñ ewọññọ ekeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke afịd esịd ye ke afịd ukpọñ ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwem ye Ñkpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Se ami iwuuk ndufo mbo enam mfịn ami isọññọ ibọhọ inyʌññọ ido ñkpọ se ndufo imiidiikanna inam. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Idooho ke hefịn, nọ ato do afo abịp abo, “Anie adiidọọk ika hefịn ikidat anye idi ndin adidọkkọ ñnyịn nọ ikop inam?” <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Inyʌññọ ido ke edem akpainyañ, nọ ato ke ado afo abịp, “Anie adiiboiyo akpainyañ ikidat anye idi ndin adidọkkọ ñnyịn nọ ikop inyʌñ inam?” <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Iyoo, ikọ anekke ikpere ndufo; asịne ke inua ndufo ye ke esịd ndufo nọ ndufo ekop enyʌñ enam.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Kap se, ami mmenịm ke iso ndufo mfịn ami uwem ye uforo, ñkpa ye nsobo. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Sia ami mmiiwuuk ndufo mfịn ami adima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, adisaña ke ñkobitem amọ, ñnyʌñ nnam mme item, mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed; ndin ndufo eyaedu enyʌñ etọt, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ayaidiọñ ndufo ke isọñ a-ndufo edʌkkọ adidat nnie.<verse eid="DEU 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Ado adieke esịd ndufo ewọññọke ndin ndufo ikoppo item, ndin ekeene etuak iwuod enọ mme abasi mfen enyʌñ ekpono ammọ, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />ami mmenwọñọ ke ana ndufo ekịt nsobo. Ndufo idiiduuho ikpeene ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaañake Yọdan adidʌk ndat nnie.<verse eid="DEU 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Mfịn ami mmekoot mme hefịn ye isọñ nte mme ntiense inọ ndufo ke ami mmenịm ke iso ndufo uwem ye ñkpa, adidiọñ ye isuuñọ. Idahami imek uwem, nọ ndufo ye nditọ ndufo edu, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />inyʌñ ima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo, ikpañ utọñ inọ uyio amọ, iyịre anye ifat ikama. Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado uwem ndufo, ndin anye ayainọ ndufo uwak isua ke isọñ a-anye akenwọñọke adinọ mme ete ndufo, Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb.<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yọsua Adiidat Itie Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Ndin Moses amaawuọ aketañ mme ikọ ami anọ afịd Isrel: <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />“Idahami ami ndo isua ikie mme edịb ndin ñkanna idat ndufo usʌñ aba. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ambo miin, ‘Afo uduukaañake Yọdan.’ <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke idem amọ ayaato akaaña mbemiso ndufo. Anye ayaasobo mme idịd ke iso ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedat isọñ ammọ enie. Yọsua ñko ayaakaaña mbemiso ndufo, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam ye ammọ se anye akenam Sihọn ye Ọk, ndidem mbon Amọọ, a-anye akesoboke adian ye isọñ ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaayaak ammọ asịn ke ubọk ndufo, ndin ana enam afịd se mbo yak ndufo enam ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Isọñ adudu inyʌñ ikop uko. Ikiibaak ammọ, ikiinyʌñ ikop ndịk ke ntak ammọ, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo a-asaña ye ndufo; anye idiikpọññọ ndufo idinyʌññọ isaana ndufo iyaak.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Ndin Moses amaakoot Yọsua anyʌñ abo anye ke iso atu afịd Isrel, “Kop adudu ye uko, sia ana afo asaña ye ibon ami akedʌk isọñ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọke anọ mme eteete ndufo adinọ ammọ, ndin ana afo abakka anye anọ ammọ nte udeemeñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke idem amọ a-asaña ke iso ndufo, ndin anye ayaaba ye ndufo; anye idiikpọññọ ndufo, idiinyʌññọ isaana ndufo iyaak. Ikiifeghe ndịk; ikiinyʌñ inie ayeemensia.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukoot Mbed Anwa-Anwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Ndin Moses amaawet mbed ami ayaak anọ mme aku Lifai, e-ekekamake akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ye afịd mme ñkpisọñ Isrel. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Ndin Moses amaawuuk ammọ ate: “Ke utịd isua itiaba, isua ubiat isọn nsio, ke ini Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />idaha a-afịd Isrel ediidibono ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo ke itie anye adiimek, ndufo eyaekoot mbed ami ke iso ammọ nọ ekop. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Ikoot afịd awo ibok, ideen, ibaan, ye ntəkayịn, ye mme adidʌñ e-edʌññọ ke mme abio ndufo, nọ ammọ ekop enyʌñ ekpeep aditeeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo enyʌñ enekke ekeene afịd mme ikọ ke mbed ami. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Nditọ ammọ, i-imiidiọọñọke mbed ami, ana ekop enyʌñ ekpeep aditeeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo adaña nte ndufo edʌñọke ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaañake Yọdan ekaa adidat nnie.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edaekịt Nsọñiwuod Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses, “Idahami usen ñkpa mfo akpere. Koot Yọsua inyʌñ iboho ke atayad mbono, ke itie a-ami ndiinọ anye ubiọñutom.” Ke ntoro Moses ye Yọsua emaedi ediwọt idem ammọ ke atayad mbono.<verse eid="DEU 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaara idem ke atayad mbono ke ntọñanyọñ, ndin ntọñanyọñ amaatuak ada ke anyenusʌñ atayad mbono. <verse eid="DEU 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Moses: “Afo ayaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete mfo, ndin idiikpeeneke ibon ami eyaesaña akpara ye mme isen abasi ke isọñ a-ammọ ekaaha. Ammọ eyaemfre miin enyʌñ ebiat edioomo a-ami ñkenamma ye ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Ndin ke usen ado ami ñyaayat esịd ye ammọ ñnyʌñ ñkanna edem ñwọt ammọ; ñyaadịp ammọ iso mmi, ndin eyaesobo ammọ. Uwak atahade ye ukuud ayaasịm ammọ, ndin ke usen ado ammọ eyaebịp, ‘Me mme ñkpọ ami isịm ñnyịn sia Abasi ñnyịn ibaaha ye ñnyịn?’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Ndin ke akpanikọ ñyaadịp iso mmi ke usen ado ke ntak afịd mbubiam ke edikeene mme abasi mfen.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Idahami wet ikwọ ami nyʌñ kpeep mbon Isrel nyʌñ nam ammọ ekwọ anye, nọ ado ntiense annọ miin ke abaña ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Ke ini ami mmaakedat ammọ ndidʌk isọñ a-afiọọrọke ye mmọọñeba ye adanakwọọk, isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke ke unwọñọ nnọ mme eteete ammọ, ndin ammọ emaedia eyʌkkọ enyʌñ eforo, ammọ eyaewọññọ ekeene mme abasi mfen ekpono ammọ, ensịn miin enyʌñ ebiat edioomo mmi. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Ndin uwak nnananyen ye ukuud emaesịm ammọ, ikwọ ami ayaado ntiense anọ ammọ, sia mme ubon ammọ idiifreke. Ami mmediọọñọ se ammọ ekeme edinam, mbemiso ndat ammọ ndisịn ke isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke ke unwọñọ.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Ndin Moses amaawet ikwọ ami usen ado anyʌñ akpeep nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Yọsua ayịn Nọn item ami: “Kop adudu ye uko, sia afo uduudat mbon Isrel usịn ke isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke ke unwọñọ nnọ ammọ, ndin ami ke idem mmi ñyaaba ye afo.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Ke Moses amaakewet mme ikọ mbed ami ke ñwed ke ntọọñọ tutu akesịm utịd, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />Moses amaanọ mme Lifai e-ekekamake akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ewʌhọ ami: <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Iben Ñwed Mbed ami inyʌñ inịm anye ke mben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ndufo. Ke ndo ke anye adiina nte ntiense inọ ndufo, <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Sia ami mmediọọñọ naña ndufo esọñ iwuod enyʌñ esọñ aboditọñ. Adieke ndufo esọññọ iwuod ye Abọọñ ke ini a-ami nsʌkkọ mba ke uwem ye ndufo, die ke ndufo ediisọñ iwuod itre ke ami mmaakpa! <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Ikoot afịd mme ñkpisọñ esiin ndufo ye mme adaaha ndufo ibok ke iso mmi, nọ ami ntañ mme ikọ ami ndọñ ke utọñ ammọ ñnyʌñ ñkoot ikpaanyọñ ye isọñ edido ntiense enọ ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Sia ami mmediọọñọ ke mmaakpa ndufo eyaenam mbubiam enyʌñ ewọññọ ekpọñ usʌñ a-ami itemmeke ndufo. Ke ini iso, nnananyen ayaisịm ndufo sia ndufo eyaenam idiọọkñkpọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> edemme ifiobesịd amọ ke se ubọk ndufo enam.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikwọ Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Ndin Moses amaatañ mme ikọ ikwọ ami tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ tutu asịm utịd anọ afịd atu awo ke Isrel ekop:<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />Ikpañ utọñ, ndufo mme hefịn, ndin ami ñyaatañ ikọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">afo isọñ, kop ikọ inua mmi.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Yak ukpeebñkpọ mmi adep aduọkkọ nte edịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">ikọ mmi anyʌñ asọiyọ nte mbara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">nte nsaha ukod edịm aduọkkọ ke ufa mbid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">nte asọñ ukod edịm aduọkkọ ke nsek eto.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Ami ñyaatañ mbaña anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">O, itooro uku Abasi ñnyịn!<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Anye ado Itiad, utom amọ a-afọn ama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">ndin afịd usʌñ amọ edo nnen-nnen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Anam akpanikọ Abasi i-imiinamma ndudue ndomokeed,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">anye ado nnekke-nnekke anyʌñ anen.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Ammọ edo ñwo inyʌññọ ido nditọ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">ke abuud ammọ enam ammọ edo atịme ye ukwañ emana.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Ntom ke ndufo esio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> usiene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">ndufo mme ndisịme ye mbon unanaifiọk?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Nte idooho anye ado Ete ndufo, Andibod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ete, Andikidep ndufo</char></note> ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">a-akinamma ndufo, a-akenyʌññọ ibot ndufo?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Itoiyo mme usen edem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">ikere mme ubon e-emaekeboiyo ke esed.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Ibịp ete ndufo ndin anye ayaidọkkọ ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">mme ñkpisọñ ndufo, ndin ammọ eyaenam inwaña ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Ke ini Andikoñ Ñkan akenọọhọ mme idịd udeemeñkpọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">ke ini anye akedeemeke afịd ubonawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">anye amanịm mme adaña anọ mbon awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">akeene ibad nditọ ideen Isrel.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Sia udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado mbon amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yekọb ado udeemeñkpọ a-anye amekke adat.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Ke isọñ akpautatan ke anye akekịt anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">ke isọñ a-ñkpọ ndomokeed imiitịppeke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Abasi amaakpeme anye, amaanyʌñ abọọk anye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">Abasi amaadịp anye nte ñkwaanyen amọ,<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />nte ntrukpuum a-atəkkoke efọk amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">anyʌñ akʌbọ ke nditọ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">a-atatta mba amọ amʌm ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">anyʌñ aben ammọ adọọk ataa anyọñ.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikpọọñ akedat anye usʌñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">asen abasi ndomokeed ikibaaha ye anye.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam anye awat ke ataa ñkoñ-ñkoñ isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">anyʌñ anọ anye ndidia a-atooho mbunwịm inwañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Anye amaabọọk anye ke adanakwọọk a-atooho itiad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">ye adan a-atooho ataa nsaad itiad,<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />ye nsọọñ mmọọñeba ñkọrọ ye ataa mmọọñeba a-atooho udịmenañ ye udịmedọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ye ukọkʌk nditọ edọñ ye mme ebod,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">ye nti akukịmedọñ e-etooho Basan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ye ataa nti uduud abakpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Afo amaanwọñ kreb a-afịtte iyiib-iyiib efuud.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Yesurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesurun awuọñọ andinen, a-adooho Isrel.</char></note> amaakọt, akpon anyʌñ atiai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">ayọhọ ye ndidia, ammọ emaedoppo enyʌñ edọọnọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Ammọ ekpọñ Abasi a-akebotto ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">enyʌñ esịn Itiad, Andinyaaña ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Ammọ emaenam anye afịbe ufịb abaña mme isen abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">enyʌñ eyat anye esịd ye mme mbubiam ubobodñkpọ ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Ammọ emaenam uwa enọ mme abasi abiaña, i-imiidooho Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">mme abasi a-ammọ imiikidiọọñọke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">mme abasi ewuọhọ edi ufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">mme abasi a-mme eteete ndufo imiikikoppo ndịk ibaña.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Ndufo emaefeeñe ekpọñ Itiad, a-akibonno ndufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">ndufo emaefre Abasi a-akimanna ndufo.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakịt ado anyʌñ asịn ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">sia nditọ amọ ideen ye ibaan emaeyat anye esịd.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Anye amaabo, “Ami ñyaadịp ammọ iso mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">ndin eyaekịt se utịd ammọ adiido;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">sia ammọ edo mbubiam emana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">nditọ i-imiinamma akpanikọ.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Ammọ emaenam ami mfịbe ufịb ke ñkpọ i-imiidooho abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">enyʌñ eñyat miin esịd ye mme ntaaha ubobodñkpọ ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Ami ñyaanam ammọ efịbe ufịb ebaña mbon i-imiidooho idịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">ami ñyaanam ammọ eyat esịd ebaña idịd i-imiinieghe ndiọọñọidem.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Sia ifiobesịd mmi ayaadomo ikañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">anye a-adiita tutu awuọ abioekpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Anye ayaasobo ederimbod ye afịd mbunwịm amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">anyʌñ asịn ikañ ke itiad idakisọñ mme ñkpoon abod.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“Ami ñyaadot ukuud nnọ ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">ñnyʌñ ñkweeñe mme idañ mmi ke idem ammọ.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Ñyaadọñ idiọọk akañ nnọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">idiọọk udọñọ ye udọñọ nsobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">ñyaadọñ mme eded ndiọi unam nnọ ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">mme ifod udʌkikọd a-anyọọnọ ke ntọñ.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ke efaak, akañkañ ayaanam ammọ enana nditọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">ke esịdufọk ammọ ndịk adiikaara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Eyaesobo mme ñkparawa ye ubọikpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">mme ntəkayịn ye mme iwuod iwad.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Ami mmaabo ke ñyaasuan ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">ñnyʌñ nsọọk anyịñ ammọ nsio mbaak editoiyo ammọ aba,<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />ado ami ñkebaak ñnyọọ mme asua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">mbaak mme asua edikappa ekere ke usʌñ mfen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">ndin ebo, ‘Ubọk ñnyịn akan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">idooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam afịd ami.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Ammọ edo idịd i-miinieghe eti iwuod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">ammọ ikoppo item, inieghe ikike.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Akpekapado ammọ enie aniọñ nọ ediikan inwaña ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">enyʌñ ediọọñọ se utịd ammọ adiido!<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Awo keed akan die abịne awo tọsịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">me awo iba adinam awo tọsịn duob efeeñe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">ibọhọke Itiad ammọ amaanyam ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">ibọhọke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịññe idem akpọñ ammọ?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Sia itiad ammọ ibaaha nte Itiad ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">kpa naña mme asua ñnyịn enyịmme.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Fain ammọ ato fain Sọdọm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">anyʌñ ato mme inwañ Komora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Mfịd kreb ammọ ayọhọ ye ñkpọñkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">ayọ kreb ammọ ayọhọ ye idod.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Ukọd ammọ ado ifod mme udʌkikọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">ibọkñkpa mme abre.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Ado nte ami nnịmme anye nte ñyọhọnsʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">ñnyʌñ nsiit anye nsịn nnịm ke itie unịmñkpọ mmi?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Usiene annie miin; ami ñyaasio usiene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">Ke akem ini, ukod ammọ ayaafiọnnọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">usen nnananyen ammọ akpere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">ndin nsobo ammọ abịmme abịne ammọ.”<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaakpe ikpe mbon amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">anyʌñ akop mbọm abaña mme isʌñutom amọ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">ke anye amaakịt ke udịd ammọ akweeñe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">ndin ibaaha awo ndomokeed se isʌhọ, ke atu afʌn me amanaisọñ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ndin ammọ inieghe andikara me andidat ammọ usʌñ</char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Anye ayaabo: “Idahami mmọ mme abasi ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">itiad ammọ ekedʌkkọ edịbe ke esịd,<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />mme abasi ekediaha akpọñ ke mme uwa ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">enyʌñ enwọñ ukọd unwọnwọñ uwa ammọ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Yak ammọ edakka eda inwam ndufo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">Yak ammọ inọ ndufo itie idʌñ!<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />“Se idahami ami ke idem mmi ndo anye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">abasi mfen ibaaha ke imiibọhọke ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Ami ñwot, ami ñnyʌñ nnọ uwem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ami mmenọ unan ndin ami ndiinyʌñ ñkọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">ndin ibaaha awo ndomokeed a-akanna afak asio ke ubọk mmi.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Ami ndịppe ubọk mmi ke hefịn ñnyʌñ ñnwọñọ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">Adaña nte ami nduuho uwem ke nsi-nsi,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />ami mmaaban ñyayamma akañkañ mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ndin ubọk mmi amʌm anye akama ke ikpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">ñyaasio usiene ye mme asua mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ñnyʌñ nsio mbon se insua miin usiene.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Ñyaanam mme idañ mmi akop inaam ato iyiib,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ke ini akañkañ mmi asoboke abʌk:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">iyiib mbon se ewot ye mbon se ebịme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">iwuod mme ñkpisọñ mme asua.”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Idaara, ndufo mme idịd, ye mbon amọ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Nam mbon amọ edaara, ndufo mme idịd</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">sia anye ayaasio usiene iyiib mbon utom amọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">anye ayaasio usiene ye mme asua ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">anyʌñ asio isob ke isọñ ye mbon amọ.<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Moses amaasaña ye Yọsua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru Hosie, usʌñ mfen naña ekoot Yọsua</char></note> ayịn awodeen Nọn amaanyʌñ atañ afịd ikọ ikwọ ami nọ afịd awo ekop. <verse eid="DEU 32:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Ke Moses amaaketañ afịd mme ikọ ami inọ Isrel, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />anye amaabo ammọ, “Idat afịd ikọ se ntañ inọọ ndufo mfịn ami isịn ke esịd, nọ ndufo ewuuk nditọ ndufo yak enekke etịñ anyen enam afịd mme ikọ mbed ami. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Ammọ idooho ikpu-ikpu ikọ inọ ndufo, ammọ edo uwem ndufo. Ato ke mme ikọ ami ndufo eyaedu anyan uwem ke isọñ a-ndufo ekaañake Yọdan adidat nnie.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moses Adiikpa ke Abod Nebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Kpa ke usen ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Moses, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Dọọk kaa Udịm Abod Abarim tutu ke Abod Nebo ke Mọb, asakka iso ase Yeriko, da se Kenan, isọñ a-ami ndiinọ mbon Isrel nte udeeme ammọ. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Do ke abod a-afo adọọhọ do afo ayaakpa ndin eyauben esọk mbon mfo, kpa naña ayịneka mfo Erọn akekpa ke Abod Họọ nọ eben anye esọk mbon amọ. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Ntak ado ke ndufo awo iba emaenana mbuọdidem ke idem mmi ke iso mbon Isrel ke mmọọñ Meriba Kades ke Akpautatan Sịn, ñko ndufo ikikponoke adisana anyịñ mmi ke atu nditọ Isrel. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Ke ntoro, afo uduuda ke anyan usʌñ ukịt isọñ ado, uduudʌkkọ isọñ a-ami ndiinọ mbon Isrel.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s1">Moses Adiọñ Mme Ekpək</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Ami ado adidiọñ ake Moses awo Abasi akediọññọ mbon Isrel mbemiso anye akpa. <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketo Sainai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">adisoobo ye ammọ ato Sei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">anye amaayama ato Abod Paran.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Anye akesaña ye udịm mme ndisana awo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">e-eketooho usuuk, ke mme usuuk abod amọ.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Ke akpanikọ ado afo ama ubon awo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">afịd mme ndisana ibon usịne fiin ke ubọk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Afịd ammọ esuuk iwuod ke ukod mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">ebọ item uto fiin,<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />mbed ake Moses akinọọhọ ñnyịn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">inie afe mbono Yekọb.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Anye akedo adidem ke Yesurun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">ke ini mme ñkpisọñ emaekeboho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">ye mme esiin Isrel.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />“Yak Rubịn adu uwem, yak akuukpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">ñko yak mbon amọ ekuusịp ke ibad.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Ndin se anye aketañ abaña Yuda ado ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">“Abọọñ, kpañ utọñ nọ aseeme Yuda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">ben anye bịne mbon amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Anye akama ubọk amọ anwana anyaaña idem amọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">Mbọk, do unwam amọ baña mme asua amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Ye ubọk amọ anye anwana anyaaña idem amọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">Mbọk, do unwam amọ baña mme asua amọ!”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Ke abaña Lifai anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">“Tumịm ye Urim mfo enie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">anam akpanikọ awo utom mfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Afo amaadomo anye ke Masa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">amaatọhọ ye anye ke mmọọñ Meriba.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Anye amaatañ abaña ete ye eka amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">‘Nnieghe ukpono nnọ ammọ.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Anye ikidiọọñọke nditọeka ideen amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">me adidiọọñọ kpa nditọ amọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">ado anye amaakpeme ikọ mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">anyʌñ akpeme edioomo mfo.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Anye akpeep Yekọb mme item mfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">anyʌñ akpeep Isrel mbed mfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Anye awa insensi unọ fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">ye ayọhọ ufọfọb uwa ke itieukpono mfo.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, diọñ afịd ukeme amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">nyʌñ nem esịd ke ubọkutom amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Sobo mbon se idakka ida inam mfịna ye anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">mme asua amọ tutu ammọ idakkake ida aba.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Ke abaña Benyamin anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">“Yak awoima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aba ke ifuuro ke anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">sia anye adịp anye afịd usen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">anye <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> amaaha anyʌñ abọ nduọkadudu ke afara amọ.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Ke abaña Yosef anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">“Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiọñ isọñ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">ye eti mbara a-aduọkkọke ato hefịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">ye ntotəño mmọọñ a-asịneke ke esịd isọñ;<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />ye afịd se ifọn ikan se utịn anie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">ye se iyaiya ikan se afiọñ akama;<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />ye ataa nti mme enọ e-etooho mme ñkaan ñkpoon abod</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">ye nseghe mfịd a-atooho mme nsi-nsi abod;<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />ye ataa nti enọ se iyọhọ ke iso isọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">ye mfọn anye a-akedʌññọ ke ikọd a-akesakka ikañ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Yak afịd ami edoro ke iwuod Yosef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">ke akpọiso ayịn adidem ke atu nditọ ete amọ.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Ke uku anye atie nte akpa ayaaraenañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">nnʌk amọ atie nte nnʌk abaakenañ ikọd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Anye adiikama ado ituak mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">tutu awuọ mbon e-ebaaha ke mme utịd ekondo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Ntoro ke ado ye mme tọsịn mbon Ifrem duob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">ntoro ke ado ye mme tọsịn mbon Manase.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Ke abaña Sebulọn anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">“Daara, Sebulọn, ke adiwuọ mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">Isaka, afo ñko, ke mme atayad mfo.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Ammọ eyaekoot mme awo edi ke ekamba abod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">ke ndo eyaenam mme uwa adinen awo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">ammọ eyaedia usọrọ ke mme uwak ñkpọ e-etooho akpainyañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">ke mme ñkpọuto e-edịbeke ke ntan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Ke abaña Kad anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">“Afọfọn anọ awo a-anamma Kad atara!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Kad adʌñ do nte ekpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">awai ubọk me iwuod.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Anye amaamek eti isọñ anọ idem amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">udeeme adadusʌñ ekenịm enọ anye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Ke mme ñkpisọñ emaekebono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">anye amaanam nnekke-nnekke uduak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">ye mme ubiideikpe amọ a-abañake Isrel.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Ke abaña Daan anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">“Daan ado ñyịn ekpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">a-asakkake ato Basan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Ke abaña Naftali anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">“Naftali ayọhọ ye mfọn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">anyʌñ ayọhọ ye adidiọñ amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">anye adinie usuuk ke ukañ isuọ.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Ke abaña Asaa anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">Andinie mfọn ñkan ke atu nditọ ideen ado Asaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">yak anye akịt mfọn ato nditọete amọ ideen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">ndin yak anye ayie ukod amọ ke adan.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Mme ekọb ke mme inuaatob mfo ediido ukwak ye brọns,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">ndin adudu mfo adiido ukem ye usen mfo.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />“Ibaaha anditie nte Abasi Yesurun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">a-awatta akaaña mme hefịn adunyaaña fiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">ye ke ntọñanyọñ ke uku amọ.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Nsi-nsi Abasi ado itie udịbe mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">ndin ke idak ado mme nsi-nsi ubọk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Anye ayaabịne mme asua mfo ke iso mfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">ate, ‘Isobo ammọ!’<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Ndin Isrel ayaadʌñ ke ifuuro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">Yekọb ayaadʌñ ke emem</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">ke isọñ abakpa ye ufa ukọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">ke itie a-mme hefịn eduọkkọ mbara.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Afọfọn inọ ndufo, Isrel!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Anie atie nte ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">mbon <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> anyaañake?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Anye ado atuekọñ ye unwam ndufo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ye akañkañ ubọọñ ndufo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Mme asua ndufo ediinyeenyeñ ke iso ndufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ndin ndufo eyaesaña esọnnọ mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ammọ.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Ndin Moses amaadọọk Abod Nebo ato ke unaisọñ Mọb tutu akewuọ anyọñ Piska, asakka iso ato Yeriko. Ke ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawọt anye afịd isọñ tọọñọ ke Kilied tutu akewuọ Daan, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />afịd Naftali, efaak Ifrem ye Manase, afịd isọñ Yuda tutu akewuọ Akpainyañ Mediterenia, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />Nekef ye afịd mbeñ Abedeñ Yeriko, Abio Ayob, tutu akewuọ Soa. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye ate, “Anye ami ado isọñ a-ami ñkenwọñọke ke unwọñọ nnọ Ebraham, Aisik ye Yekọb idaha añkebooho, ‘Ami ñyaanọ ubon mfo isọñ ado.’ Ami mmenam afo amekịt anye ke anyen mfo, ado uduukaañake udʌk.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Ndin Moses awoutom <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakpa do ke Mọb, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />Anye amaabuuk anye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido Emaebuuk anye</char></note> ke Mọb, ke abedeñ a-asakkaiso ase Bed Pio, ado tutu nte usen mfịn ami awo ndomokeed idiọọñọke itie nte udi amọ ada. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Moses akedo isua ikie ye edịb idaha anye akekpaaha, ado anyen amọ ikikịmme, adudu amọ ikiinyʌññọ ikweeñe. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Mbon Isrel emaefʌhọ Moses ke unaisọñ Mọb ke usen edịb mme duob, tutu afịd ini utua ayịd ye mfʌhọ aboiyo.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Ndin sịbidịd aniọñ amaayọhọ Yọsua ayịn Nọn idem sia Moses amaadot anye ubọk. Ndin mbon Isrel emaekpañ utọñ enọ anye enyʌñ enam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo Moses.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Tọọñọ ke ini ado, ibaaha prọfed a-atooho Isrel awuọ a-abaaha nte Moses, <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akediọọñọke iso ye iso, <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />akenamma afịd mme idiọọñọ ye mme utịppeñkpọ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akedọññọ anye anam ke Iyib ye Fero ye afịd mme adaaha amọ ye afịd isọñ Iyib. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Sia ibaaha awo a-akewọttọ akpọsọñ adudu me a-akenamma mme aniendịk ñkpọ se Moses akenam ke iso afịd Isrel.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>